    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- la culture du riz"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Anbau von Reis"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
