<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- growing of unmanufactured tobacco"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- la culture du tabac non manufacturé"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Anbau von unverarbeitetem Tabak"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- coltivazione di tabacco grezzo (tabacco non lavorato)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n- preliminary processing of tobacco when associated with the growing of tobacoo"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- la transformation préliminaire du tabac lorsqu'elle est associée à la culture du tabac"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Erstverarbeitung von Tabak, in Verbindung mit dem Anbau von Tabak"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- prima trasformazione del tabacco connessa alla sua coltivazione"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of tobacco products, see 120000\n- preparation of tobacco leaves (e.g. sun drying) by a third party, see 016300"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la préparation des feuilles de tabac (par ex. le séchage au soleil) par un tiers, voir 016300\n- la fabrication de produits à base de tabac, voir 120000"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Aufbereiten von Tabakblättern (z. B. Sonnentrocknung), siehe 016300\n- Tabakverarbeitung, siehe 120000"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011500/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di prodotti del tabacco, cfr. 120000\n- attività di preparazione delle foglie di tabacco, ad esempio essiccazione, da parte di terzi, cfr. 016300"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/0116> a skos:Concept ;
