    skos:prefLabel "Anbau von Faserpflanzen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Coltivazione di piante tessili"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011600> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "011600" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Growing of fibre crops"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/0116> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Culture de plantes à fibres"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Anbau von Faserpflanzen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Coltivazione di piante tessili"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011600/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011600/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011600/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011600/note/inclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011600/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes growing of fibre crops, e.g.:\n\n- growing of cotton\n\n- growing of jute, kenaf and other textile bast fibres\n\n- growing of flax and hemp\n\n- growing of sisal and other textile fibre of the genus agave\n\n- growing of abaca, ramie and other vegetable textile fibres"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011600/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend la culture de plantes à fibres, par ex. :\n- la culture du coton\n- la culture du jute, du kenaf et d'autres fibres textiles libériennes\n- la culture du lin et du chanvre\n- la culture de sisal et d'autres fibres textiles du genre agave\n- la culture de l'abaca, de la ramie et d'autres fibres textiles végétales"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011600/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst den Anbau von Faserpflanzen, z. B.:\n- Baumwolle\n- Jute, Kenaf und sonstigen textilen Bastfasern\n- Flachs und Hanf\n- Sisal und sonstigen textilen Agavefasern\n- Abaca (Manilahanf), Ramie und sonstigen pflanzlichen Textilfasern"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/011600/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include la coltivazione di colture da fibra, ad esempio\n- coltivazione di cotone\n- coltivazione di iuta, kenaf e altre fibre tessili di rafia (fibre tessili liberiane)\n- coltivazione di lino e canapa\n- coltivazione di agave sisalana e altre fibre tessili della specie agave\n- coltivazione di abaca, ramia e altre fibre tessili vegetali"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/0119> a skos:Concept ;
