    skos:prefLabel "Anbau von Kern- und Steinobst"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Coltivazione di pomacee e frutta a nocciolo"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "012400" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Growing of pome fruits and stone fruits"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/0124> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Culture de fruits à pépins et à noyau"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Anbau von Kern- und Steinobst"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Coltivazione di pomacee e frutta a nocciolo"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- growing of pome fruits and stone fruits, e.g.:\n\n • apples\n\n • apricots\n\n • cherries and sour cherries\n\n • peaches and nectarines\n\n • pears and quinces\n\n • plums and sloes"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- la culture de fruits à pépins et de fruits à noyau, par ex. :\n\n • pommes\n\n • abricots\n\n • cerises et cerises acides\n\n • pêches et nectarines\n\n • poires et coings\n\n • prunes et prunelles"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Anbau von Kern- und Steinobst, z. B.:\n  • Äpfel\n  • Aprikosen/Marillen\n  • Kirschen und Sauerkirschen\n  • Pfirsiche und Nektarinen\n  • Birnen und Quitten\n  • Pflaumen/Zwetschken und Schlehen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- coltivazione di pomacee e frutta a nocciolo, ad esempio:\n • mele\n • albicocche\n • ciliegie e amarene\n • pesche e nettarine\n • pere e mele cotogne\n • prugne e susine"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- growing of mangoes, rambutans and lychees, see 012200\n\n- growing of olives, see 012600"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n\n- la culture des mangues, des ramboutans et des litchis, voir 012200\n\n- la culture des olives, voir 012600"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Anbau von Mangos, Rambutan und Litschis, siehe 012200\n- Anbau von Oliven, siehe 012600"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012400/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- coltivazione di mango, rambutani e litchi, cfr. 012200\n- coltivazione di olive, cfr. 012600"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/0125> a skos:Concept ;
