    skos:prefLabel "Coltivazione di altri alberi da frutto, frutti di bosco e frutta in guscio"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "012500" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Growing of other tree and bush fruits and nuts"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/0125> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Culture d’autres fruits d’arbres ou d’arbustes et de fruits à coque"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Anbau von sonstigem Obst und Nüssen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Coltivazione di altri alberi da frutto, frutti di bosco e frutta in guscio"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- growing of berries, e.g.:\n • blueberries\n • fresh currants\n • gooseberries\n • kiwi fruit\n • raspberries\n • strawberries\n • sea buckthorn\n- growing of fruit seeds\n- growing of edible nuts, e.g.:\n • almonds\n • cashew nuts\n • chestnuts\n • hazelnuts\n • pistachios\n • walnuts\n • pine nuts\n- growing of other tree and bush fruits, e.g.:\n • locust beans"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la culture de baies, par ex. :\n • myrtilles\n • groseilles fraîches\n • groseilles à maquereau\n • kiwi\n • framboises\n • fraises\n • argousier\n • culture de graines de fruits\n- culture de fruits à coque comestibles, par ex. :\n • amandes\n • noix de cajou\n • châtaignes\n • noisettes\n • pistaches\n • noix\n • pignons de pin\n- la culture d'autres fruits d'arbres et d'arbustes, par ex. :\n • caroubes"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Anbau von Beeren, z. B.:\n  • Heidelbeeren\n  • Johannisbeeren\n  • Stachelbeeren\n  • Kiwi\n  • Himbeeren\n  • Erdbeeren\n  • Sanddorn\n- Anbau von Obstsamen\n- Anbau von essbaren Nüssen, z. B:\n  • Mandeln\n  • Cashewnüsse\n  • Edelkastanien (Esskastanien)\n  • Haselnüsse\n  • Pistazien\n  • Walnüsse\n  • Pinienkerne\n- Anbau von sonstigen Baum- und Strauchfrüchten, z. B:\n  • Johannisbrotsamen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- coltivazione di bacche, ad esempio:\n • mirtilli\n • ribes rosso\n • uva spina\n • kiwi\n • lamponi\n • fragole\n • olivello spinoso\n- coltivazione di sementi da frutta\n- coltivazione di frutta a guscio commestibile, ad esempio:\n • mandorle\n • anacardi\n • castagne (e marroni)\n • nocciole\n • pistacchi\n • noci comuni\n • pinoli\n- coltivazione di altri alberi da frutto, ad esempio:\n • carrubo"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- growing of coconuts, see 012600"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n\n- la culture des noix de coco, voir 012600"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Anbau von Kokosnüssen, siehe 012600"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/012500/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- coltivazione di noci di cocco, cfr. 012600"@it .

