<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/014400/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- raising and breeding of camels (dromedary) and camelids"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/014400/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- l'élevage et la reproduction de chameaux (dromadaires) et de camélidés"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/014400/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Zucht und Haltung von Dromedaren und anderen Kamelen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/014400/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- allevamento e riproduzione di cammelli (dromedari) e camelidi"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/0145> a skos:Concept ;
