<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/072/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This group includes the mining of non-ferrous metal ores."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/072/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce groupe comprend l'extraction de minerais de métaux non ferreux."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/072/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Gruppe umfasst den Bergbau auf nichteisenhaltige Metallerze."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/072/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo gruppo include l'estrazione di minerali metallici non ferrosi."@it .

