    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of margarine and similar edible fats"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1042> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de margarine et graisses comestibles similaires"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Margarine u. Ä. Nahrungsfetten"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di margarina e di grassi alimentari simili"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/104200/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/104200/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/104200/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/104200/note/inclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/104200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of margarine\n\n- manufacture of melanges and similar spreads\n\n- manufacture of compound cooking fats"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/104200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de margarine\n- la fabrication de mélanges et de pâtes à tartiner similaires\n- la fabrication de graisses composées pour la cuisson des aliments"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/104200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Margarine\n- Herstellung von Mischungen und ähnlichen Brotaufstrichen\n- Herstellung von gemischten Brat- oder Backfetten"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/104200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di margarina\n- produzione di grassi da spalmare e simili\n- produzione di grassi idrogenati"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "105" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of dairy products and edible ice"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/10> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de produits laitiers et de glace alimentaire"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Milcherzeugnissen und Speiseeis"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di prodotti lattiero-caseari e gelati"@it ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This group excludes:\n- production of plant-based milk substitutes, see 110700"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce groupe ne comprend pas :\n- la production de substituts de lait d'origine végétale, voir 110700"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Gruppe umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Milchersatzprodukten auf pflanzlicher Basis, siehe 110700"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo gruppo non include:\n- produzione di succedanei del latte a base vegetale, cfr. 110700"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1051> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1051" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of dairy products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de produits laitiers"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Milcherzeugnissen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di prodotti lattiero-caseari"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "105101" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of fresh dairy products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1051> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de produits laitiers frais"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Frischmilchprodukten"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di prodotti caseari freschi"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of fresh liquid milk, pasteurised, sterilised, homogenised and/or ultra-heat treated\n\n- manufacture of milk-based drinks\n\n- manufacture of cream from fresh liquid milk, pasteurised, sterilised, homogenised\n\n- manufacture of butter\n\n- manufacture of yoghurt"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de lait frais liquide, pasteurisé, stérilisé, homogénéisé et/ou upérisé (UHT)\n- la fabrication de boissons lactées non alcoolisées\n- la fabrication de crème à partir de lait frais liquide, pasteurisé, stérilisé, homogénéisé\n- la fabrication de beurre\n- la fabrication de yaourt"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von frischer, flüssiger Milch, pasteurisiert, sterilisiert, homogenisiert und/oder ultrahocherhitzt\n- Herstellung von Getränken auf Milchbasis\n- Herstellung von Rahm aus frischer, flüssiger Milch, pasteurisiert, sterilisiert, homogenisiert\n- Herstellung von Butter\n- Herstellung von Joghurt"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di latte liquido fresco, pastorizzato, sterilizzato, omogeneizzato, inclusa la produzione di latte sottoposto a trattamento Uht per la lunga conservazione\n- produzione di bevande a base di latte\n- produzione di panna ottenuta con latte liquido fresco, pastorizzato, sterilizzato, omogeneizzato\n- produzione di burro\n- produzione di yogurt"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- production of raw milk of cattle, see 014100\n- production of raw milk of sheep, goats, horses, asses, camels, etc., see 014300, 014400, 014500\n- manufacture of non-dairy milk (e.g. plant-based milk), see 110700\n- manufacture of cheese substitutes, see 108900"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de lait cru de vache, voir 014100\n- la fabrication de lait cru de brebis, de chèvre, de jument, d'ânesse, de chamelle, etc., voir 014300, 014400, 014500\n- la fabrication de lait non laitier (p. ex. lait végétal), voir 110700\n- la fabrication de substituts de fromage, voir 108900"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Erzeugung von roher Kuhmilch, seihe 014100\n- Erzeugung von Rohmilch von Schafen, Ziegen, Pferden, Eseln, Kamelen usw., siehe 014300, 014400, 014500\n- Herstellung von Milch auf pflanzlicher Basis, siehe 110700\n- Herstellung von Käseersatzprodukten, siehe 108900"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105101/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di latte crudo bovino, cfr. 014100\n- produzione di latte crudo ovino, caprino, equino, da asini, da camelidi, eccetera, cfr. 014300, 014400, 014500\n- produzione di latte non di latteria, ad esempio latte a base vegetale, cfr. 110700\n- produzione di succedanei del formaggio, cfr. 108900"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "105102" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of cheese"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1051> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de fromage"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Käse"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di formaggio"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of cheese and curd\n- refining and ageing cheese"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de fromage et de séré\n- l'affinage et la maturation du fromage"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Käse und Quark/Topfen\n- Veredelung und Reifung von Käse"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di formaggio e cagliata\n- affinatura e stagionatura di formaggio"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of cheese substitutes, see 108900"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de substituts de fromage, voir 108900"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Käseersatzprodukten, siehe 108900"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105102/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di succedanei del formaggio, cfr. 108900"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "105103" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Other milk processing"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1051> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication d'autres produits laitiers"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von anderen Milchprodukten"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di altri prodotti lattiero-caseari"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of dried or concentrated milk, whether or not sweetened\n- manufacture of milk or cream in solid form\n- manufacture of whey\n- manufacture of casein\n- manufacture of lactose-free dairy products"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de laits en poudre ou de laits concentrés, édulcorés ou non\n- la fabrication de lait ou de crème sous forme solide\n- la fabrication de lactosérum\n- la fabrication de caséine\n- la fabrication de produits laitiers sans lactose"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von getrockneter oder eingedickter Milch, auch mit Zusatz von Zucker oder anderen Süssmitteln\n- Herstellung von Milch oder Rahm in fester Form\n- Herstellung von Molke\n- Herstellung von Kasein\n- Herstellung von lactosefreien Milchprodukten"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di latte in polvere o concentrato, dolcificato o meno\n- produzione di latte o panna in forma solida\n- produzione di siero di latte\n- produzione di caseina"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- manufacture of milk kefir\n\n- manufacture of lactose and lactose syrup"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication de kéfir de lait\n\n- la fabrication de lactose et de sirop de lactose"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von Milchkefir\n- Herstellung von Lactose und Lactosesirup"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- produzione di kefir di latte\n- produzione di lattosio e sciroppo di lattosio"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- production of milk-based dietary drinks, see 108600\n\n- production of dairy-based infant formulae, see 108600\n\n- manufacture of fruit kefir and water kefir, see 110300"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n\n- la production de boissons diététiques à base de lait, voir 108600\n\n- la production de préparations pour nourrissons à base de produits laitiers, voir 108600\n\n- la fabrication de kéfir de fruits et de kéfir d'eau, voir 110300"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von diätetischen Getränken auf Milchbasis, siehe 108600\n- Herstellung von Säuglingsanfangsnahrung auf Milchbasis, siehe 108600\n- Herstellung von Fruchtkefir und Wasserkefir, siehe 110300"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105103/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di bevande dietetiche a base di latte, cfr. 108600\n- produzione di formule per lattanti, cfr. 108600\n- produzione di kefir di frutta e kefir di acqua, cfr. 110300"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1052> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1052" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of ice cream and other edible ice"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de crèmes glacées et autres glaces alimentaires"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Speiseeis"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di gelati"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "105200" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of ice cream and other edible ice"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1052> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de crèmes glacées et autres glaces alimentaires"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Speiseeis"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di gelati"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of ice cream and other edible ice (e.g. sorbet)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de crèmes glacées et d'autres glaces comestibles (par ex. sorbets)"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Speiseeis, Sorbets u. Ä."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di gelati e altri prodotti simili, ad esempio sorbetto"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- production of ice from natural water for cooling purposes, see 353000\n- activities of ice cream parlours, see 561101"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la production de glace à partir d'eau naturelle à des fins de refroidissement, voir 353000\n- les activités des salons de consommation de crème glacée, voir 561101"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Eis aus natürlichem Wasser zu Kühlzwecken, siehe 353000\n- Betrieb von Eissalons, siehe 561101"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/105200/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di ghiaccio da acqua naturale finalizzata al raffreddamento, cfr. 353000\n- attività di gelaterie, cfr. 561101"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "106" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of grain mill products, starches and starch products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/10> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Travail des grains; fabrication de produits amylacés"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Mahl- und Schälmühlen, Herstellung von Stärke und Stärkeerzeugnissen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Lavorazione di granaglie, produzione di amidi e di prodotti amidacei"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This group includes the milling of flour or meal from grains or vegetables, the cleaning, polishing and milling of rice, as well as the micronisation and thermal processing of flour and the manufacture of flour mixes or doughs from these products."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce groupe comprend la mouture de farines ou de semoules à partir de céréales ou de légumes, la mouture, le nettoyage et le polissage du riz, ainsi que la fabrication de mélanges de farines ou de pâtes préparés à partir de ces produits."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Gruppe umfasst das Mahlen von Getreide oder Gemüse zu Griess oder Mehl, das Reinigen, Polieren und Schleifen von Reis sowie die Mikronisierung und thermische Behandlung von Mehl und die Herstellung von Mehlmischungen oder Teigen aus diesen Erzeugnissen."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo gruppo include la molitura di farina o farina di cereali o ortaggi, la pulizia, la lucidatura e la molitura di riso, nonché la produzione di miscele di farina o di impasti a partire da questi prodotti."@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Also included in this group are the wet milling of corn and vegetables and the manufacture of starch and starch products. This group also includes the manufacture of gluten-free mill products."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce groupe comprend également la mouture du maïs et des légumes par voie humide et la fabrication d'amidon et de produits amylacés. Ce groupe comprend également la fabrication de produits de mouture sans gluten."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Gruppe umfasst ferner das Nassmahlen von Mais und Gemüse sowie die Herstellung von Stärke und von Erzeugnissen daraus. Auch die Herstellung glutenfreier Müllereierzeugnisse wird dieser Gruppe zugeordnet."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "In questo gruppo sono incluse anche la macinazione a umido di mais e ortaggi e la produzione di amido e prodotti amidacei.\nQuesto gruppo include anche la produzione di prodotti senza glutine (prodotti gluten-free) derivanti dalla lavorazione di granaglie."@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This group excludes:\n- grain drying on a fee or contract basis, see 016300"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce groupe ne comprend pas :\n- le séchage des céréales exercé pour le compte de tiers, voir 016300"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Gruppe umfasst nicht:\n- Getreidetrocknung im Lohnauftrag, siehe 016300"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo gruppo non include:\n- essiccazione di cereali, su base remunerativa o contrattuale (per conto terzi), cfr. 016300"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1061> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1061" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of grain mill products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Travail des grains"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Mahl- und Schälmühlen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Lavorazione di granaglie"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "106100" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of grain mill products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1061> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Travail des grains"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Mahl- und Schälmühlen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Lavorazione di granaglie"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- grain milling: production of flour, semolina, groats, meal or pellets of wheat, rye, oats, maize (corn) or other cereal grains\n- rice milling: production of husked, milled, polished, glazed, parboiled or converted rice; production of rice flour\n- vegetable milling: production of flour or meal of dried leguminous vegetables, of roots or tubers, or of edible nuts\n- manufacture of cereal breakfast foods\n- manufacture of flour mixes and prepared blended flour and dough for bread, cakes, biscuits, pancakes, etc."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la mouture des grains : production de farines, de gruaux, de semoules ou d'agglomérés sous forme de pellets, de blé, de seigle, d'avoine, de maïs ou d'autres grains de céréales\n- la préparation du riz : la production de riz décortiqué, blanchi, poli, glacé, étuvé ou converti, la production de farine de riz\n- la préparation des légumes: la production de farines ou de semoules de légumes à cosse secs, de racines ou de tubercules, ou de fruits à coque comestibles\n- la fabrication d'aliments pour le petit-déjeuner à base de céréales\n- la fabrication de mélanges de farines et de farines mélangées préparées pour la fabrication de pains, de gâteaux, de biscuits, de crêpes, etc."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Mahlen von Getreide: Erzeugung von Mehl, Grobgriess, Feingriess oder Pellets aus Weizen, Roggen, Hafer, Mais oder anderen Getreidekörnern\n- Schleifen von Reis: Erzeugung von geschältem, geschliffenem, poliertem, glasiertem, parboiled oder verarbeitetem Reis; Herstellung von Reismehl\n- Mahlen von Hülsenfrüchten und Nüssen: Herstellung von Mehl aus getrockneten Hülsenfrüchten, von Wurzeln und Knollen oder von essbaren Nüssen\n- Herstellung von Frühstückscerealien\n- Herstellung von Mischungen aus Mehl und von fertig zubereitetem Mehl und Teig für Brot, Kuchen, Kekse, Pfannkuchen/Palatschinken usw."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- lavorazione di granaglie: produzione di farina, semolino, semole, farina o agglomerati di segale, avena, mais o altri cereali\n- lavorazione di riso: produzione di riso decorticato, lavorato, lucidato, brillato, essiccato o convertito; produzione di farina di riso\n- lavorazione di ortaggi: produzione di farina o sfarinati di legumi da granella secchi, di radici o tuberi o di frutta a guscio commestibile\n- produzione di cereali per la prima colazione\n- produzione di preparati e farine miscelate e impasti per prodotti di panetteria, pasticceria e biscotteria, eccetera"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- preparation of crops for primary markets (e.g. cleaning, trimming, grading, etc.), see 016300\n- grain drying, on a fee or contract basis, see 016300\n- manufacture of potato flour and meal, see 103100\n- wet corn milling, see 106200"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la préparation des cultures en vue de leur commercialisation primaire (par ex. nettoyage, taille, calibrage, etc.), voir 016300\n- le séchage de céréales exercé pour le compte de tiers, voir 016300\n- la fabrication de farines et de fécules de pommes de terre, voir 103100\n- la mouture du maïs par voie humide, voir 106200"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Aufbereitung von pflanzlichen Erzeugnissen für Rohstoffmärkte (z. B. Reinigen, Beschneiden, Sortieren usw.), siehe 016300\n- Getreidetrocknung im Lohnauftrag, siehe 016300\n- Herstellung von Kartoffelmehl und -griess, siehe 103100\n- Nassmahlen von Mais, siehe 106200"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106100/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- attività di preparazione delle colture (del raccolto) per i mercati primari, ad esempio pulitura, taglio o rifilatura, cernita, eccetera, cfr. 016300\n- essiccazione di cereali, su base remunerativa o contrattuale (per conto terzi), cfr. 016300\n- produzione di farina e fecola di patate, cfr. 103100\n- macinatura umida di granoturco, cfr. 106200"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1062> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1062" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of starches and starch products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de produits amylacés"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Stärke und Stärkeerzeugnissen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di amidi e di prodotti amidacei"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "106200" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of starches and starch products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1062> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de produits amylacés"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Stärke und Stärkeerzeugnissen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di amidi e di prodotti amidacei"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of starches from rice, potatoes, maize, etc.\n\n- wet corn milling\n\n- manufacture of glucose, glucose syrup, maltose, inulin, etc.\n\n- manufacture of gluten\n\n- manufacture of tapioca and tapioca substitutes prepared from starch\n\n- manufacture of corn oil"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de produits amylacés à partir de riz, de pommes de terre, de maïs, etc.\n- la mouture du maïs par voie humide\n- la fabrication de glucose, de sirop de glucose, de maltose, d'inuline, etc.\n- la fabrication de gluten\n- la fabrication de tapioca et de substituts de tapioca préparés à partir d'amidon\n- la fabrication d'huile de maïs"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Stärke aus Reis, Kartoffeln, Mais usw.\n- Nassmahlen von Mais\n- Herstellung von Glucose, Glucosesirup, Maltose, Inulin usw.\n- Herstellung von Gluten (Lebensmittelkleber)\n- Herstellung von Tapioka und ähnlichen Stärkemitteln\n- Herstellung von Maisöl"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di amidi di riso, patate, mais, eccetera\n- macinatura umida di granoturco\n- produzione di glucosio, sciroppo di glucosio, maltosio, inulina, eccetera\n- produzione di glutine\n- produzione di farina di tapioca e succedanei\n- produzione di olio di granoturco (olio di mais)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- manufacture of lactose (milk sugar), see 105103\n\n- production of cane or beet sugar, see 108100"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de lactose, voir 105103\n- la production de sucre de canne ou de betterave, voir 108100"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Lactose (Milchzucker), siehe 105103\n- Herstellung von Rohr- oder Rübenzucker, siehe 108100"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/106200/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di lattosio (zucchero del latte), cfr. 105103\n- produzione di zucchero di canna o barbabietola, cfr. 108100"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "107" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of bakery and farinaceous products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/10> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de produits de boulangerie-pâtisserie et de pâtes alimentaires"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Back- und Teigwaren"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di prodotti da forno e farinacei"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/additionalContentNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This group includes the production of bakery products, macaroni, noodles and similar products."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce groupe comprend la production de produits de boulangerie, de pâtes alimentaires et d'autres produits similaires."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Gruppe umfasst die Herstellung von Backwaren, Makkaroni, Nudeln und ähnlichen Produkten."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo gruppo include la produzione di prodotti di panetteria, pasta (ad esempio maccheroni, spaghetti e tagliatelle, inclusa pasta ripiena) e prodotti simili."@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This group also includes:\n\n- manufacture of gluten-free bakery and farinaceous products"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce groupe comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication de produits de boulangerie et de farines sans gluten"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Gruppe umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung glutenfreier Back- und Teigwaren"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo gruppo include inolte:\n- la produzione di prodotti da forno e farinacei senza glutine (prodotti gluten-free)."@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1071> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1071" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of bread; manufacture of fresh pastry goods and cakes"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de pain; fabrication de pâtisserie fraîche"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Backwaren, ohne Dauerbackwaren"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di pane; produzione di prodotti di pasticceria freschi"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "107100" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of bread; manufacture of fresh pastry goods and cakes"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1071> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de pain; fabrication de pâtisserie fraîche"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Backwaren, ohne Dauerbackwaren"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di pane; produzione di prodotti di pasticceria freschi"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of bakery products:\n\n • bread and rolls\n\n • pastry, cakes, pies, tarts, pancakes, waffles, etc."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- la fabrication de produits de boulangerie :\n\n • pain et petits pains\n\n • pâtisseries, gâteaux, tartes, crêpes, gaufres, etc."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Backwaren:\n  • Brot und Brötchen/Sammeln\n  • feine Backwaren wie Kuchen, Torten, Pfannkuchen/Palatschinken, Waffeln usw."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di prodotti da forno:\n • produzione di pane e panini\n • produzione di prodotti di pasticceria freschi, ad esempio dolci, torte, crostate, frittelle (pancake), cialde (waffle), eccetera"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- manufacture of pre-baked bread"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication de pain précuit"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von vorgebackenem Brot"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- produzione di pane precotto"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of dry bakery products, see 107200\n- manufacture of pastas, see 107300\n- retail sale of bread and rolls baked on the premises from pre-baked products, see 472400"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de produits de boulangerie secs, voir 107200\n- la fabrication de pâtes alimentaires, voir 107300\n- le commerce de détail de pains et petits pains cuits sur place à partir de produits précuits, voir 472400"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Dauerbackwaren, siehe 107200\n- Herstellung von Teigwaren, siehe 107300\n- Einzelhandel mit Brot und Brötchen/Semmeln, die vor Ort aus vorgebackenen Produkten hergestellt werden, siehe 472400"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107100/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di prodotti da forno secchi, cfr. 107200\n- produzione di pasta, ad esempio maccheroni, spaghetti e tagliatelle, cfr. 107300\n- cottura di pane e panini precotti se connessa alla vendita al dettaglio, cfr. 472400"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1072> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1072" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of rusks, biscuits, preserved pastries and cakes"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de biscuits, biscottes et pâtisseries de conservation"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Dauerbackwaren"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di fette biscottate, biscotti, prodotti di pasticceria conservati"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "107200" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of rusks, biscuits, preserved pastries and cakes"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1072> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de biscuits, biscottes et pâtisseries de conservation"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Dauerbackwaren"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di fette biscottate, biscotti, prodotti di pasticceria conservati"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of rusks, biscuits and other dry bakery products\n\n- manufacture of preserved pastry goods, cakes and waffles\n\n- manufacture of snack products (cookies, crackers, pretzels, etc.), whether sweet or salted"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de biscottes, de biscuits et d'autres produits de boulangerie sec\n- la fabrication de pâtisseries de conservation, de gâteaux et de gaufres\n- la fabrication de produits de grignotage (biscuits, crackers, bretzels, etc.), sucrés ou salés"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Zwieback, Keksen und anderen trockenen Backwaren\n- Herstellung von Dauerbackwaren\n- Herstellung von süssen oder salzigen Snacks (Spritzgebäck, Kräcker, Brezeln usw.)"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di fette biscottate, biscotti e altri prodotti secchi da forno\n- produzione di prodotti di pasticceria conservati, incluse cialde (waffle)\n- produzione di snack dolci o salati (cracker, salatini, eccetera)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- manufacture of breadcrumbs, obtained by grinding toasted bread"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication de chapelure, obtenue par broyage de pain grillé"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von Paniermehl, das durch Mahlen von geröstetem Brot gewonnen wird"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- produzione di pane grattugiato ottenuto dalla macinazione di pane tostato"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- manufacture of potato snacks, see 103100"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n\n- la fabrication de snacks à base de pommes de terre, voir 103100"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Kartoffelsnacks, siehe 103100"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107200/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di snack a base di patate, cfr. 103100"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1073> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1073" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of farinaceous products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de pâtes alimentaires"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Teigwaren"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di prodotti farinacei"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "107300" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of farinaceous products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1073> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de pâtes alimentaires"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Teigwaren"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di prodotti farinacei"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of pastas (e.g. macaroni and noodles, whether or not cooked or stuffed)\n- manufacture of couscous"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de pâtes alimentaires (par ex. de macaronis et de nouilles, même cuites ou farcies)\n- la fabrication de couscous"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Teigwaren (z. B. Makkaroni und Nudeln), auch gekocht oder gefüllt\n- Herstellung von Couscous"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di pasta, ad esempio maccheroni, spaghetti e tagliatelle, inclusa pasta ripiena\n- produzione di cuscus (cous cous)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of prepared meals and dishes based on pasta and/or couscous dishes, see 108500\n- manufacture of soup containing pasta, see 108900"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de plats préparés à base de pâtes alimentaires et/ou de semoule, voir 108500\n- la fabrication de soupes contenant des pâtes, voir 108900"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung zubereiteter Teigwaren- und Couscous-Gerichte, siehe 108500\n- Herstellung von Suppen, die Teigwaren enthalten, siehe 108900"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/107300/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di piatti pronti a base di pasta o a base di cuscus (cous cous), cfr. 108500\n- produzione di zuppe a base di pasta, cfr. 108900"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "108" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of other food products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/10> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication d’autres produits alimentaires"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von sonstigen Nahrungsmitteln"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di altri prodotti alimentari"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108/note/inclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This group includes the production of sugar and confectionery, prepared meals and dishes, coffee, tea and spices."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce groupe comprend la production de sucre et de confiseries, de plats préparés, de café, de thé et d'épices."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Gruppe umfasst die Herstellung von Zucker und Süsswaren, Fertiggerichten, Kaffee, Tee und Gewürzen."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo gruppo include la produzione di zucchero e dolciumi, pasti e piatti pronti, caffè, tè e spezie."@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1081> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1081" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of sugar"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de sucre"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Zucker"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di zucchero"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "108100" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of sugar"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1081> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de sucre"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Zucker"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di zucchero"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture or refining of sugar (sucrose) and sugar substitutes from the juice of cane, beet, maple and palm\n\n- manufacture of sugar syrups\n\n- manufacture of molasses\n\n- production of maple syrup and sugar"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication ou le raffinage du sucre (saccharose) et des succédanés du sucre obtenus à partir de jus de canne, de betterave, d'érable ou de palme\n- la fabrication de sirops de sucre\n- la fabrication de mélasse\n- la production de sirop et de sucre d'érable"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung oder Raffination von Zucker (Saccharose) und hieraus erzeugten Zuckerarten aus dem Saft von Zuckerrohr, Zuckerrüben, Ahorn und Palmen\n- Herstellung von Zuckersirup\n- Herstellung von Melasse\n- Herstellung von Ahornsirup und Ahornzucker"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione o raffinazione di zucchero (saccarosio) e succedanei derivanti da succo di canna, barbabietola, acero e palma\n- produzione di sciroppi di zucchero\n- produzione di melassa\n- produzione di sciroppo e zucchero di acero"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- gathering of maple syrup in the wild, see 023000\n\n- manufacture of lactose and lactose syrup, see 105103\n\n- manufacture of glucose, glucose syrup, maltose, see 106200"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la récolte du sirop d'érable à l'état sauvage, voir 023000\n- la fabrication de lactose et de sirop de lactose, voir 105103\n- la fabrication de glucose, de sirop de glucose, de maltose, voir 106200"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Gewinnung von Ahornsirup von wild wachsenden Bäumen, siehe 023000\n- Herstellung von Lactose und Lactosesirup, siehe 105103\n- Herstellung von Glucose, Glucosesirup, Maltose, siehe 106200"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108100/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- raccolta di sciroppo di acero in natura, cfr. 023000\n- produzione di lattosio e sciroppo di lattosio, cfr. 105103\n- produzione di glucosio, sciroppo di glucosio, maltosio, cfr. 106200"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1082> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1082" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of cocoa, chocolate and sugar confectionery"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de cacao, de chocolat et de produits de confiserie"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Süsswaren, ohne Dauerbackwaren"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di cacao, cioccolato, caramelle e confetterie"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108201> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "108201" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of cocoa and chocolate"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1082> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de cacao et de chocolat"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Kakao- und Schokoladeerzeugnissen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di cacao e cioccolato"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108201/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108201/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108201/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108201/note/inclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108201/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of cocoa, cocoa butter, cocoa fat, cocoa oil\n\n- manufacture of chocolate and chocolate confectionery"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108201/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de cacao, de beurre de cacao, de graisse de cacao, d'huile de cacao\n- la fabrication de chocolat et de confiseries à base de chocolat"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108201/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Kakao, Kakaobutter, Kakaofett, Kakaoöl\n- Herstellung von Schokolade und Schokoladenwaren"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108201/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di cacao in polvere, burro di cacao, grasso e olio di cacao\n- produzione di cioccolato e di dolciumi al cioccolato"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "108202" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of confectionery and sugar confectionery"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1082> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de confiserie"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Zuckerwaren"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di confetterie"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of sugar confectionery: caramels, cachous, nougats, fondant, white chocolate\n- manufacture of chewing gum\n- preserving in sugar of fruits, nuts, fruit peels and other parts of plants\n- manufacture of confectionery lozenges and pastilles\n- manufacture of sugar-free confectionery"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de sucreries : caramels, cachous, nougats, fondants, chocolat blanc\n- la fabrication de chewing-gums\n- la conservation dans le sucre de fruits, de noix, d'écorces de fruits et d'autres parties de plantes\n- la fabrication de pastilles de confiserie\n- la fabrication de confiseries sans sucre"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Zuckerwaren: Weichkaramellen, Bonbons, Nougats, Fondants, weisse Schokolade\n- Herstellung von Kaugummi\n- Haltbarmachen von Obst, Nüssen, Fruchtschalen und anderen Pflanzenteilen in Zucker\n- Herstellung von süssen Hustenbonbons und Pastillen\n- Herstellung von zuckerfreien Süsswaren"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di dolciumi: caramelle, confetti, torroni, fondenti, cioccolato bianco\n- produzione di gomme da masticare\n- lavorazione dolciaria di frutta, frutta a guscio, scorze di frutta e altre parti di piante\n- produzione di caramelle e pastiglie\n- produzione di dolciumi senza zucchero (dolciumi sugar-free)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- manufacture of sucrose sugar, see 108100"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de saccharose, voir 108100"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Saccharosezucker, siehe 108100"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108202/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di saccarosio, cfr. 108100"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1083> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1083" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Processing of tea and coffee"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Transformation du thé et du café"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Verarbeitung von Kaffee und Tee, Herstellung von Kaffee-Ersatz"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Lavorazione di tè e caffè"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "108300" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Processing of tea and coffee"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1083> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Transformation du thé et du café"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Verarbeitung von Kaffee und Tee, Herstellung von Kaffee-Ersatz"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Lavorazione di tè e caffè"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- decaffeinating and roasting of coffee\n\n- production of coffee products:\n\n • ground coffee\n\n • soluble coffee\n\n • extracts and concentrates of coffee\n\n- manufacture of coffee substitutes\n\n- blending of tea and maté\n\n- manufacture of extracts and preparations based on tea or maté"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la décaféination et la torréfaction du café\n- la production de produits à base de café :\n • café moulu\n • café soluble\n • extraits et concentrés de café\n- la fabrication de succédanés de café\n- le mélange du thé et du maté\n- la fabrication d'extraits et de préparations à base de thé ou de maté"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Entkoffeinieren und Rösten von Kaffee\n- Herstellung von Kaffeeprodukten:\n  • gemahlener Kaffee\n  • löslicher Kaffee\n  • Auszüge und Konzentrate aus Kaffee\n- Herstellung von Kaffee-Ersatz\n- Mischen von Tee und Mate\n- Herstellung von Auszügen und Zubereitungen aus Tee oder Mate"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- decaffeinazione e torrefazione del caffè\n- produzione di prodotti a base di caffè:\n • caffè macinato\n • caffè solubile\n •  estratti e concentrati di caffè\n- produzione di surrogati del caffè\n- miscelatura di tè e matè\n- produzione di estratti e preparati a base di tè o matè"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- manufacture of herb infusions (mint, vervain, chamomile, etc.)\n\n- manufacture of tea and coffee filled in bags, pads or capsules"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication d'infusions (menthe, verveine, camomille, etc.)\n\n- la fabrication de thé et de café conditionnés en sachets, en plaquettes ou en capsules"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von Kräutertees (Pfefferminze, Eisenkraut, Kamille usw.)\n- Herstellung von Tee und Kaffee, abgefüllt in Beuteln, Pads oder Kapseln"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- produzione di infusi di erbe (menta, verbena, camomilla, eccetera)\n- produzione di tè e caffè in bustine, cialde o capsule"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- drying, sorting, cleaning and cutting in the processing of medicinal herbs by third parties, see 016300\n- manufacture of inulin, see 106200\n- manufacture of spirits, beer, wine and soft drinks, see division 11\n- preparation of botanical products for pharmaceutical use, see 212000"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- le séchage, le triage, le nettoyage et la coupe lors de la transformation des plantes médicinales effectués par des tiers, voir 016300\n- la fabrication d'inuline, voir 106200\n- la fabrication de spiritueux, de bière, de vin et de boissons non alcoolisées, voir division 11\n- la préparation de produits botaniques à usage pharmaceutique, voir 212000"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Trocknen, Sortieren, Reinigen und Schneiden zur Verarbeitung von Heilkräutern im Lohnauftrag, siehe 016300\n- Herstellung von Inulin, siehe 106200\n- Herstellung von Spirituosen, Bier, Wein und Erfrischungsgetränken, siehe Abteilung 11\n- Aufbereitung von pflanzlichen Erzeugnissen für pharmazeutische Zwecke, siehe 212000"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/108300/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- essiccazione, cernita, pulitura e taglio di erbe medicinali da parte di terzi, cfr. 016300\n- produzione di inulina, cfr. 106200\n- produzione di alcolici, birra, vino e bibite (bevande) analcoliche, cfr. divisione 11\n- preparazione di prodotti botanici per uso farmaceutico, cfr. 212000"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1084> a skos:Concept ;
