    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of wine of fresh grapes\n\n- manufacture of sparkling wine\n\n- manufacture of fortified wines\n\n- manufacture of wine from concentrated grape must"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de vin\n- la fabrication de vin mousseux\n- la fabrication de vin fortifié\n- la fabrication de vin à partir de moût de raisin concentré"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Wein aus frischen Weintrauben\n- Herstellung von Schaumwein\n- Herstellung von mit Alkohol angereichertem Wein\n- Herstellung von Wein aus konzentriertem Traubenmost"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di vino da uve fresche\n- produzione di vino spumante\n- produzione di vini liquorosi (fortificati)\n- produzione di vini da mosto di uva concentrato"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- blending, purification and bottling of wine\n\n- manufacture of low or non-alcoholic wine"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- le mélange, la purification et la mise en bouteille du vin\n- la fabrication de vin à faible teneur en alcool ou sans alcool"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Verschneiden, Reinigen und Flaschenabfüllung von Wein\n- Herstellung von Wein mit geringem oder ohne Alkoholgehalt"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- miscelatura, purificazione e imbottigliamento di vini\n- produzione di vino analcolico o di vino a basso contenuto alcolico"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- manufacture of wine from raisins, see 110300\n\n- merely bottling and labelling, see 4634 (if performed as part of wholesale) and 829200 (if performed on a fee or contract basis)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de vin à partir de raisins secs, voir 110300\n- l'embouteillage et l'étiquetage, voir 4634 (s'ils font partie du commerce de gros) et 829200 (s'ils sont effectués pour le compte de tiers)"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Wein aus getrockneten Weintrauben (Rosinen), siehe 110300\n- lediglich Abfüllen und Etikettieren, siehe 4634 (falls im Grosshandel durchgeführt) und 829200 (falls im Lohnauftrag durchgeführt)"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110200/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di vini da uva passa (vini passiti), cfr. 110300\n- operazioni di imbottigliamento ed etichettatura se effettuate nell'ambito del commercio all'ingrosso, cfr. 4634\n- operazioni di imbottigliamento ed etichettatura se effettuate su base remunerativa o contrattuale (per conto terzi), cfr. 829200"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1103> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1103" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of cider and other fermented fruit beverages"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de cidre et autres boissons fermentées à base de fruits"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Apfelwein und sonstigen gegorenen Getränken aus Obst"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di sidro e di altre bevande fermentate a base di frutta"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "110300" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of cider and other fermented fruit beverages"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1103> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de cidre et autres boissons fermentées à base de fruits"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Apfelwein und sonstigen gegorenen Getränken aus Obst"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di sidro e di altre bevande fermentate a base di frutta"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of fermented but not distilled alcoholic beverages: mead, sake, cider, perry and other fruit wines\n\n- manufacture of wine from raisins"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de boissons alcoolisées fermentées mais non distillées : hydromel, saké, cidre, poiré et autres vins de fruits\n- la fabrication de vin à partir de raisins secs"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von gegorenen, aber nicht destillierten alkoholhaltigen Getränken: Met, Sake, Apfel- oder Birnenwein und andere Obstweine\n- Herstellung von Wein aus getrockneten Weintrauben (Rosinen)"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di bevande alcoliche fermentate ma non distillate: idromele, sakè, sidro, sidro di pere e altri vini a base di frutta\n- produzione di vini da uva passa (vini passiti)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- manufacture of mixtures of fermented beverages and non-alcoholic beverages n.e.c.\n\n- manufacture of fruit kefir and water kefir"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication de mélanges de boissons fermentées et de boissons non alcoolisées n.c.a.\n\n - la fabrication de kéfir de fruits et de kéfir d'eau"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von Mischungen gegorener Getränke und alkoholfreier Getränke a. n. g.\n- Herstellung von Fruchtkefir und Wasserkefir"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- produzione di miscele di bevande fermentate e bevande analcoliche n.c.a.\n- produzione di kefir di frutta e kefir di acqua"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- manufacture of wine from grapes , see 110200\n\n- merely bottling and labelling, see 4634 (if performed as part of wholesale) and 829200 (if performed on a fee or contract basis)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de vin à partir de raisins, voir 110200\n- l'embouteillage et l'étiquetage, voir 4634 (s'ils font partie du commerce de gros) et 829200 (s'ils sont effectués pour le compte de tiers)"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Traubenwein, siehe 110200\n- lediglich Abfüllen und Etikettieren, siehe 4634 (falls im Grosshandel durchgeführt) und 829200 (falls im Lohnauftrag durchgeführt)"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110300/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- produzione di vini da uve non connessa alla coltivazione di uva, cfr. 110200\n- operazioni di imbottigliamento ed etichettatura se effettuate nell'ambito del commercio all'ingrosso, cfr. 4634\n- operazioni di imbottigliamento ed etichettatura se effettuate su base remunerativa o contrattuale (per conto terzi), cfr. 829200"@it .

