<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110500/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of malt liquors (e.g. beer, ale, porter, stout)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110500/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de liqueurs de malt (par ex. la bière, l'ale, le porter, le stout)"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110500/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Bier aus Malz (z. B. Starkbier, Ale, Porter, Stout)"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110500/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di liquori al malto, inclusa qualsiasi tipologia di birra con diversi gradi di fermentazione (ad esempio birra, ale, porter, stout)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110500/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- manufacture of low alcohol or non-alcoholic beer"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110500/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication de bière à faible teneur en alcool ou sans alcool"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110500/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von Bier mit geringem oder ohne Alkoholgehalt"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/110500/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- produzione di birra analcolica o di birra a basso contenuto alcolico"@it .

