<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/132002/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of woollen-type, worsted-type fabrics, including from mixtures or artificial or synthetic yarns"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/132002/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de tissus de type laine - cycle cardé, y compris à partir de mélanges ou de fils artificiels ou synthétiques"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/132002/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Woll- und Kammgarnstoffen, auch aus Mischungen oder künstlichen oder synthetischen Garnen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/132002/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- fabbricazione di tessuti a trama larga di lana, lana pettinata, incluse miscele o filati artificiali o sintetici"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/132002/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
