    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes finishing of textiles and wearing apparel, in other words, bleaching, dyeing, dressing and similar activities.\n\nThis type includes:\n- bleaching and dyeing of textile fibres, yarns, fabrics and textile articles, including wearing apparel\n- dressing, drying, steaming, shrinking, mending, sanforising, mercerising of textiles and textile articles, including wearing apparel"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend l'ennoblissement des textiles et des vêtements, c'est-à-dire, le blanchiment, la teinture, l'habillage et les activités similaires.\n\nCe genre comprend :\n- le blanchiment et la teinture de fibres textiles, de fils, de tissus et d'articles textiles, y compris les vêtements\n- l'apprêtage, le séchage, le vaporisage, le décatissage, le stoppage, le sanforisage, le mercerisage de textiles et d'articles textiles, y compris les vêtements"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst die Veredlung von Spinnstoffen und Bekleidung, z. B. durch Bleichen, Färben, Appretieren und ähnliche Verfahren.\n\nDiese Art umfasst:\n- Bleichen und Färben von Spinnstoffen, Garnen, Stoffen und Spinnstoffwaren, einschliesslich Bekleidung\n- Appretieren, Trocknen, Dämpfen, Krumpfen, Ausbessern, Sanforisieren, Merzerisieren von Spinnstoffen und Spinnstoffwaren, einschliesslich Bekleidung"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include il finissaggio di prodotti tessili e di abbigliamento cioè le attività di candeggio, tintura, confezionamento e altre attività simili.\n\nQuesto genere include:\n- candeggio e tintura di fibre tessili, filati, tessuti e articoli tessili, inclusi gli articoli di abbigliamento\n- apprettatura, asciugatura, vaporizzazione, restringimento, rammendatura, sanforizzazione, mercerizzazione di tessili e di articoli tessili, inclusi articoli di abbigliamento"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n- bleaching of jeans\n- pleating and similar work on textiles\n- waterproofing, coating, rubberising, or impregnating purchased garments\n- printing of textile fabrics as an intermediate process within the manufacture of textiles"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- la décoloration de jeans\n- le plissage et les travaux similaires sur les textiles\n- l'imperméabilisation, l'enduction, le caoutchoutage ou l'imprégnation de vêtements achetés\n- l'impression de textiles en tant que processus intermédiaire dans la fabrication de textiles"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Bleichen von Jeans\n- Plissieren und ähnliche Behandlung von Spinnstoffen\n- Abdichten gegen Wasser, Beschichten, Gummieren oder Imprägnieren gekaufter Kleidung\n- Bedrucken von Geweben als Zwischenschritt bei der Herstellung von Spinnstoffen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- decolorazione di jeans\n- pieghettatura di tessuti e lavori simili\n- impermeabilizzazione, rivestimento, gommatura o impregnatura di indumenti\n- stampa su tessuti come processo intermedio nella fabbricazione di tessili"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- printing, including silkscreen printing, on textiles and wearing apparel, not as an intermediate process in manufacture of textiles, see 181209\n- laser engraving on textiles, see 181209\n- manufacture of textile fabric impregnated, coated, covered or laminated with rubber where rubber is the primary constituent, see 221200"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- l'impression, y compris la sérigraphie, sur des textiles et des vêtements, non utilisée comme procédé intermédiaire dans la fabrication de textiles, voir 181209\n- la gravure au laser sur textiles, voir 181209\n- la fabrication de tissus imprégnés, enduits, recouverts ou stratifiés de caoutchouc lorsque le caoutchouc est le constituant principal, voir 221200"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Bedrucken, einschliesslich Siebdruck, von Spinnstoffen und Bekleidung, nicht als Zwischenschritt bei der Herstellung von Textilien, siehe 181209\n- Lasergravur auf Textilien, siehe 181209\n- Herstellung von mit Kautschuk getränktem, bestrichenem, überzogenem oder laminiertem Gewebe, wenn Kautschuk den Hauptbestandteil darstellt, siehe 221200"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/133000/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- stampa, inclusa stampa serigrafica su prodotti tessili e articoli di abbigliamento, non come processo intermedio nella fabbricazione di tessili, cfr. 181209\n- incisione laser su prodotti tessili, cfr. 181209\n- fabbricazione di tessuti impregnati, spalmati, ricoperti o laminati con gomma, in cui la gomma è il componente principale, cfr. 221200"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "139" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of other textiles"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/13> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication d’autres textiles"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von sonstigen Textilwaren"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Altre fabbricazioni tessili"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139/note/inclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This group includes the manufacture of products produced from textiles, except wearing apparel (for example, made-up textile articles, carpets and rugs, rope, narrow woven fabrics, trimmings)."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce groupe comprend la fabrication de produits fabriqués à partir de textiles, à l'exception des vêtements (par ex. les articles textiles confectionnés, les tapis et moquettes, les cordes, les tissus étroits, la passementerie)."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Gruppe umfasst die Herstellung von Erzeugnissen aus Spinnstoffen ausser Bekleidung (z. B. konfektionierte Textilwaren, Teppiche, Brücken und Läufer, Seilerwaren, Bänder, Posamentierwaren)."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo gruppo include la fabbricazione di prodotti tessili, ad eccezione di articoli di abbigliamento, ad esempio articoli tessili confezionati, tappeti e moquette, corde, nastri, passamanerie."@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1391> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1391" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of knitted and crocheted fabrics"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication d’étoffes à mailles"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von gewirktem und gestricktem Stoff"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di tessuti a maglia e all'uncinetto"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "139100" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of knitted and crocheted fabrics"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1391> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication d’étoffes à mailles"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von gewirktem und gestricktem Stoff"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di tessuti a maglia e all'uncinetto"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture and processing of knitted or crocheted fabrics:\n\n • pile and terry fabrics\n\n • net and window furnishing type fabrics\n\n • other knitted or crocheted fabrics"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication et la transformation d'étoffes à mailles :\n • velours, peluches et étoffes bouclées\n • tissus pour filets et pour l'ameublement des fenêtres\n • autres étoffes à mailles"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung und Verarbeitung von Gewirken und Gestricken:\n  • Samt-, Plüsch- und Frottiergewirke\n  • netz- und gardinenartige Stoffe\n  • sonstige gestrickte und gewirkte Stoffe"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- fabbricazione e lavorazione di tessuti a maglia o all'uncinetto:\n • tessuti in pile e spugna\n • tessuti a rete e per finestre\n • altri tessuti a maglia o all'uncinetto"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- manufacture of imitation fur by knitting"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication d'imitation de fourrure par tricotage"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von nachgeahmtem Pelz durch Stricken"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- fabbricazione di imitazioni di pelliccia mediante tessitura a maglia"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- manufacture of net and window furnishing type fabrics of lace, see 139902\n\n- manufacture of knitted and crocheted apparel, see 1410"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de filets et de tissus d'ameublement pour fenêtres en dentelle, voir 139902\n- la fabrication de vêtements, voir 1410"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von netz- und gardinenartigen Stoffen aus Spitze, siehe 139902\n- Herstellung von gestrickter und gewirkter Bekleidung, siehe 1410"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139100/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di tessuti a rete e di pizzi e merletti per l'arredamento di finestre, cfr. 139902\n- fabbricazione di articoli a maglia e all'uncinetto, cfr. 1410"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1392> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1392" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of household textiles and made-up furnishing articles"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de textiles ménagers et d’articles d’ameublement confectionnés"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Heimtextilien und konfektionierten Textilwaren für die Innenausstattung"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di tessili per la casa e l’arredo"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "139201" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of household textiles"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1392> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de textiles ménagers"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Heimtextilien"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di tessili per la casa"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture, of made-up household textiles articles of any material, including of knitted or crocheted fabrics, e.g.:\n • blankets, including travelling rugs\n • bed, table, toilet or kitchen linen\n • quilts, eiderdowns, cushions, pouffes, pillows, sleeping bags"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication d'articles textiles ménagers confectionnés, en toutes matières, y compris en étoffes à mailles, par ex. :\n • couvertures, y compris les plaids\n • linge de lit, de table, de toilette ou de cuisine\n • couettes, édredons, coussins, poufs, oreillers, sacs de couchage"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von konfektionierten Spinnstoffwaren für den Haushalt aus Stoffen aller Art, einschliesslich aus Gestricken und Gewirken, z. B:\n • Decken, einschliesslich Reisedecken\n • Bettwäsche, Tischwäsche, Wäsche zur Körperpflege oder Küchenwäsche\n • Steppdecken, Daunendecken, Polster, Schlummerrollen, Kopfkissen, Schlafsäcke"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- fabbricazione di articoli tessili per la casa confezionati di qualsiasi materiale, inclusi quelli a maglia o all'uncinetto:\n • coperte, plaid\n • biancheria da letto, da tavola, da bagno o da cucina\n • trapunte, piumini, cuscini, pouf, guanciali, sacchi a pelo"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- manufacture of hand-woven tapestries"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication de tapisseries tissées à la main"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von handgewebten Wandteppichen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- fabbricazione di arazzi tessuti a mano"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of napkins and napkin liners for babies, period panties and similar articles of textile materials, see 172200"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de serviettes de table, de protège-couches pour bébés, de culottes de grossesse et d'articles similaires en matières textiles, voir 172200"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Windeln und Windeleinlagen für Säuglinge und Kleinkinder, Periodenunterwäsche und ähnlichen Waren aus Spinnstoffen, siehe 172200"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139201/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di salviette e pannolini per bambini, mutandine mestruali e articoli simili di materiali tessili, cfr. 172200"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/139202> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "139202" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of made-up furnishing articles"@en ;
