    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142102/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142102/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of women's and girls’ outerwear, other than knitted or crocheted (e.g. pullovers, cardigans, jersey, coats, suits, ensembles, jackets, trousers, skirts, shirts, T-shirts, blouses)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142102/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de vêtements de dessus pour femmes et filles, autres qu'en bonneterie, par ex. pulls, cardigans, maillots, manteaux, costumes, ensembles, vestes, pantalons, jupes, chemises, T-shirts, chemisiers"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142102/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Oberbekleidung für Frauen und Mädchen, ausgenommen solche aus Gestricken oder Gewirken (z. B. Pullover, Strickjacken, Mäntel, Anzüge, Kostüme, Jacken, Hosen, Röcke, Hemden, T-Shirts, Blusen)"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142102/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- fabbricazione di indumenti esterni per donne e ragazze, diversi da quelli a maglia, ad esempio pullover, cardigan, maglie, cappotti, abiti, completi (tailleur), giacche, pantaloni, gonne, camicie, magliette, camicette"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142102/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of knitted and crochetted apparel, e.g. pullovers, cardigans, jerseys, shirts, T-shirts, blouses, waistcoats, nightwear, underwear, including babies’ wear, see 141002"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142102/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de vêtements et d'autres articles confectionnés en bonneterie (par ex. pulls, cardigans, maillots, chemises, T-shirts, chemisiers, gilets, vêtements de nuit, sous-vêtements, y compris les vêtements pour bébés), voir 141002"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142102/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von gestrickter oder gewirkter Bekleidung (z. B. Pullover, Strickjacken, Hemden, T-Shirts, Blusen, Westen, Nachtwäsche, Unterwäsche, einschliesslich Bekleidung für Kleinkinder), siehe 141002"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142102/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di articoli di abbigliamento realizzati a maglia e all’uncinetto (ad esempio pullover, cardigan, maglie, camicie, T-shirt, camicette, gilet, indumenti da notte, biancheria intima, inclusi indumenti per neonati), cfr. 141002"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "142103" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of non-specific outerwear"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1421> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de vêtements de dessus sans prédominance"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Oberbekleidung ohne ausgeprägten Schwerpunkt"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Confezione di abbigliamento esterno senza predominanza"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of outerwear, other than knitted or crocheted, for women, men and children, equally combined (e.g. pullovers, cardigans, jersey, coats, suits, ensembles, jackets, trousers, skirts, shirts, T-shirts, blouses, babies’ outerwear garments)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de vêtements d'extérieur, autres qu'en bonneterie, pour femmes, hommes et enfants, sans prédominance (par ex. pulls, cardigans, maillots, manteaux, manteaux, costumes, ensembles, vestes, pantalons, jupes, chemises, T-shirts, chemisiers, vêtements d'extérieur pour bébés)"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Oberbekleidung für Frauen, Männer und Kinder in gleichen Teilen, ausgenommen solche aus Gestricken oder Gewirken. (z. B. Pullover, Strickjacken, Mäntel, Anzüge, Kostüme, Jacken, Hosen, Röcke, Hemden, T-Shirts, Blusen, Oberbekleidung für Kleinkinder)"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- fabbricazione di indumenti esterni, diversi da quelli a maglia, per donna, uomo e bambino, senza predominanza (ad esempio pullover, cardigan, maglie, cappotti, abiti, completi, giacche, pantaloni, gonne, camicie, magliette, camicette, indumenti esterni per neonati)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- bridal dresses and other clothes for ceremony\n\n- custom tailoring"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- les robes de mariée et autres vêtements de cérémonie\n\n- la couture sur mesure"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von Brautkleidern und anderer Kleidung für Zeremonien\n- Massanfertigung"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- fabbricazione di abiti da sposa e altri vestiti da cerimonia confezionati in serie\n- sartoria su misura"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of knitted and crochetted apparel, e.g. pullovers, cardigans, jerseys, shirts, T-shirts, blouses, waistcoats, nightwear, underwear, including babies’ wear, see 141002"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de vêtements et d'autres articles confectionnés en bonneterie (par ex. pulls, cardigans, maillots, chemises, T-shirts, chemisiers, gilets, vêtements de nuit, sous-vêtements, y compris les vêtements pour bébés), voir 141002"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von gestrickter oder gewirkter Bekleidung (z. B. Pullover, Strickjacken, Hemden, T-Shirts, Blusen, Westen, Nachtwäsche, Unterwäsche, einschliesslich Bekleidung für Kleinkinder), siehe 141002"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142103/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di articoli di abbigliamento realizzati a maglia e all’uncinetto (ad esempio pullover, cardigan, maglie, camicie, T-shirt, camicette, gilet, indumenti da notte, biancheria intima, inclusi indumenti per neonati), cfr. 141002"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1422> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "1422" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of underwear"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/142> ;
