<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "191000" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of coke oven products"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/1910> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Cokéfaction"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Kokerei"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di prodotti di cokeria"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- operation of coke ovens\n\n- production of coke and semi-coke\n\n- production of pitch and pitch coke\n\n- production of coke oven gas\n\n- production of crude coal and lignite tars\n\n- agglomeration of coke"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- l'exploitation de fours à coke\n- la production de coke et de semi-coke\n- la production de brai et de coke de brai\n- la production de gaz de cokerie\n- la production de goudrons houille et de lignite\n- l'agglomération de coke"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Betrieb von Koksöfen\n- Herstellung von Koks und Schwelkoks\n- Herstellung von Pech und Pechkoks\n- Herstellung von Kokereigas\n- Herstellung von Steinkohle- und Braunkohlerohteer\n- Agglomerieren von Koks"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- gestione di cokerie\n- fabbricazione di coke e semi-coke\n- fabbricazione di pece e coke di pece\n- fabbricazione di gas di cokeria\n- fabbricazione di catrame di carbon fossile e catrame di lignite\n- agglomerazione di coke"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- manufacture of coal fuel briquettes, see 192000"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n\n- la fabrication de briquettes de charbon, voir 192000"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Brennstoffbriketts aus Steinkohle, siehe 192000"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/191000/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di bricchette di carbone combustibile, cfr. 192000"@it .

