    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von synthetischem Kautschuk in Primärformen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di gomma sintetica in forme primarie"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "201700" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of synthetic rubber in primary forms"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2017> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de caoutchouc synthétique"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von synthetischem Kautschuk in Primärformen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di gomma sintetica in forme primarie"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of synthetic rubber in primary forms:\n\n • synthetic rubber\n\n • factice\n\n- manufacture of mixtures of synthetic rubber and natural rubber or rubber-like gums (e.g. balata)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de caoutchouc synthétique sous forme primaire :\n • caoutchouc synthétique\n • caoutchouc factice\n- la fabrication de mélanges de caoutchouc synthétique et de caoutchouc naturel ou de gommes semblables au caoutchouc (par ex. balata)"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von synthetischem Kautschuk in Primärformen\n  • synthetischer Kautschuk\n  • Faktis\n- Herstellung von Mischungen aus synthetischem Kautschuk und Naturkautschuk oder kautschukähnlichen Gummiharzen (z. B. Balata)"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- fabbricazione di gomma sintetica in forme primarie:\n • gomma sintetica\n • factice\n- fabbricazione di miscele di gomma sintetica e naturale o simili alla gomma, ad esempio balata"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- sorting, shredding, cleaning, grinding and pelletising of rubber waste, see 382100"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n\n- le tri, le déchiquetage, le nettoyage, le broyage et la granulation des déchets de caoutchouc, voir 382100"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Sortieren, Zerkleinern, Reinigen, Mahlen und Pelletieren von Kautschukabfällen, siehe 382100"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/201700/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- selezione, frantumazione, pulizia, macinazione e pellettizzazione di rifiuti in gomma, cfr. 382100"@it .

