    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/23> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de ciment, chaux et plâtre"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Zement, Kalk und gebranntem Gips"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di cemento, calce e gesso"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2351> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "2351" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of cement"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de ciment"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Zement"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di cemento"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "235100" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of cement"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2351> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de ciment"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Zement"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di cemento"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of clinker and hydraulic cements, including Portland cement, aluminous cement, slag cement, supersulphate cement and similar hydraulic cements, whether or not coloured or in the form of clinker"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- la fabrication de clinker et de ciments hydrauliques, y compris le ciment Portland, le ciment alumineux, le ciment de laitier, le ciment supersulfate et les ciments hydrauliques similaires, qu'ils soient ou non colorés ou sous forme de clinker"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Klinker und Hydraulikzementen einschliesslich Portlandzement, Tonerdezement, Schlackenzement, Sulfathüttenzement und ähnlichen Hydraulikzementen, auch gefärbt oder in Form von Klinker"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di cementi non polverizzati (clinkers) e di cementi idraulici, inclusi cemento Portland, cemento alluminoso, cemento di scoria e cementi superfosfati e altri cementi idraulici simili, anche non colorati o sotto forma di clinker"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- manufacture of refractory mortars, concrete, etc., see 232000\n\n- manufacture of ready-mixed and dry-mix concrete and mortars, see 236300, 236400\n\n- manufacture of articles of cement, see 236500, 236600\n\n- manufacture of cements used in dentistry, see 325009"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de mortiers réfractaires, bétons, etc., voir 232000\n- la fabrication de béton et de mortiers prêts à l'emploi ou à l'état sec, voir 236300, 236400\n- la fabrication d'articles en ciment, voir 236500, 236600\n- la fabrication de ciments utilisés en dentisterie, voir 325009"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von feuerfesten Mörteln, feuerfestem Beton usw., siehe 232000\n- Herstellung von bereits gemischtem Beton und von Trockenbeton und -mörtel, siehe 236300, 236400\n- Herstellung von Erzeugnissen aus Zement, siehe 236500, 236600\n- Herstellung von Zementen für zahnärztliche Zwecke, siehe 325009"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235100/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di malte refrattarie e calcestruzzi refrattari, eccetera, cfr. 232000\n- produzione di calcestruzzo e malte preconfezionati e pronti per l'uso, cfr. 236300, 236400\n- fabbricazione di articoli in cemento, cfr. 236500, 236600\n- fabbricazione di cementi per uso odontoiatrico, cfr. 325009"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2352> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "2352" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of lime and plaster"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de chaux et plâtre"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Kalk und gebranntem Gips"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di calce e gesso"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "235200" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of lime and plaster"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2352> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de chaux et plâtre"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Kalk und gebranntem Gips"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di calce e gesso"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- manufacture of quicklime, slaked lime and hydraulic lime\n\n- manufacture of plasters of calcined gypsum or calcium sulphate"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- la fabrication de chaux vive, de chaux éteinte et de chaux hydraulique\n\n- la fabrication d'enduits de gypse calciné ou de sulfate de calcium"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von ungelöschtem und gelöschtem Luftkalk sowie hydraulischem Kalk\n- Herstellung von Gips aus gebranntem Gipsstein oder aus Calciumsulfat"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di calce viva, calce spenta e calce idraulica\n- produzione di intonaci di gesso calcinato o solfato calcinato"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- manufacture of calcined or sintered dolomite"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication de dolomie calcinée ou frittée"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von gebranntem oder gesintertem Dolomit"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- produzione di dolomite calcinata o sinterizzata"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of pure calcium oxide and calcium hydroxide, see 201200\n- manufacture of articles of plaster, see 236200, 236600"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication d'oxyde de calcium et d'hydroxyde de calcium purs, voir 201200\n- la fabrication d'articles en plâtre, voir 236200, 236600"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von reinem Calciumoxid (ungelöschter Kalk) und Calciumhydroxid (gelöschter Kalk), siehe 201200\n- Herstellung von Erzeugnissen aus Gips, siehe 236200, 236600"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/235200/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di ossido e idrossido di calcio puri, cfr. 201200\n- fabbricazione di articoli di gesso, cfr. 236200, 236600"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "236" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of articles of concrete, cement and plaster"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/23> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication d’ouvrages en béton, en ciment ou en plâtre"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Erzeugnissen aus Beton, Zement und Gips"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di prodotti in calcestruzzo, cemento e gesso"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2361> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "2361" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of concrete products for construction purposes"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication d’éléments en béton pour la construction"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Erzeugnissen aus Beton, Zement und Kalksandstein für den Bau"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di prodotti in calcestruzzo per l’edilizia"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "236100" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of concrete products for construction purposes"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2361> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication d’éléments en béton pour la construction"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Erzeugnissen aus Beton, Zement und Kalksandstein für den Bau"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di prodotti in calcestruzzo per l’edilizia"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of precast concrete, cement or artificial stone articles for use in construction:\n • tiles, flagstones, building blocks, bricks, boards, sheets, panels, pipes, posts, etc.\n- manufacture of prefabricated structures and structural components for building or civil engineering, traffic control and obstruction, of cement, concrete or artificial stone\n- manufacture of prefabricated factory-made elements of brick for construction of prefabricated structures to be used in landscaping and retaining wall, wastewater and stormwater management, and underground utilities\n- manufacture of factory-made elements with concrete\n- manufacture of prefabricated concrete pipes for drinking water"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication d'articles préfabriqués en béton, en ciment ou en pierre artificielle destinés à la construction :\n • tuiles, dalles, blocs de construction, briques, planches, plaques, panneaux, tuyaux, poteaux, etc.\n- la fabrication de structures préfabriquées et d'éléments structuraux pour le bâtiment ou le génie civil, le contrôle et l'obstruction de la circulation, en ciment, en béton ou en pierre artificielle\n- la fabrication d'éléments préfabriqués en briques pour la construction de structures préfabriquées pour l'aménagement paysager, les murs de soutènement, la gestion des eaux usées et des eaux pluviales, et les services publics souterrains\n- la fabrication d'éléments préfabriqués en béton\n- la fabrication de tuyaux préfabriqués en béton pour l'eau potable"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Fertigteilen aus Beton, Zement oder Kunststein für Bauzwecke:\n  • Fliesen, Pflasterplatten, Mauersteine, Tafeln, Platten, Paneele, Rohre, Pfosten usw.\n- Herstellung von vorgefertigten Konstruktionen und Bauelementen aus Zement, Beton oder Kunststein für Hoch- und Tiefbau, Verkehrsüberwachung, -steuerung und -behinderung\n- Herstellung von vorgefertigten, werkseitig hergestellten Elementen aus Mauersteinen für den Bau von vorgefertigten Konstruktionen zur Verwendung im Landschaftsbau und bei Stützmauern, in der Abwasser- und Regenwasserbewirtschaftung sowie bei unterirdischen Versorgungseinrichtungen\n- Herstellung von werkseitig hergestellten Elementen aus Beton\n- Herstellung von vorgefertigten Betonrohren für Trinkwasser"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- fabbricazione di elementi prefabbricati in calcestruzzo, cemento o pietra artificiale per l'edilizia:\n • piastrelle, lastricati, blocchi da costruzione, mattoni, assi, lastre, pannelli, tubi, pali e colonne, eccetera\n- fabbricazione di strutture prefabbricate e di componenti strutturali per l'edilizia o l'ingegneria civile, il controllo e l'ostruzione del traffico, in cemento, calcestruzzo o pietra artificiale\n- fabbricazione di elementi prefabbricati per la costruzione di strutture prefabbricate da utilizzare per la sistemazione del paesaggio e per i muri di sostegno (muri di contenimento), per la gestione delle acque reflue e meteoriche e per i servizi sotterranei\n- fabbricazione di elementi prodotti industrialmente in calcestruzzo\n- fabbricazione di tubi prefabbricati in calcestruzzo per acqua potabile"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- manufacture of calcium silicate masonry units\n\n- manufacture of autoclaved aerated concrete masonry units"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication d'éléments de maçonnerie en silicate de calcium\n\n- la fabrication d'éléments de maçonnerie en béton cellulaire autoclavé"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von Mauersteinen aus Calciumsilicat\n- Herstellung von Mauersteinen aus Porenbeton"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- fabbricazione di elementi per muratura in silicato di calcio\n- fabbricazione di elementi per muratura in calcestruzzo aerato autoclavato"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of other articles of concrete, cement and plaster not for use in construction, see 236600"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication d’autres ouvrages en béton, en ciment ou en plâtre non destinés à la construction, voir 236600"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von sonstigen Erzeugnissen aus Beton, Zement und Gips, nicht für Bauzwecke, siehe 236600"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236100/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di altri prodotti in calcestruzzo, cemento e gesso non per l'edilizia, cfr. 236600"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2362> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "2362" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of plaster products for construction purposes"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication d’éléments en plâtre pour la construction"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Gipserzeugnissen für den Bau"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di prodotti in gesso per l’edilizia"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236200> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "236200" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of plaster products for construction purposes"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2362> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication d’éléments en plâtre pour la construction"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Gipserzeugnissen für den Bau"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di prodotti in gesso per l’edilizia"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236200/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236200/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236200/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236200/note/inclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of articles of plaster or compositions based on plaster for use in construction:\n • boards, sheets, panels, tiles and similar articles, not ornamented"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication d'articles en plâtre ou à base de plâtre destinés à la construction :\n • planches, plaques, panneaux, carreaux et articles similaires, non ornés"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Waren aus Gips oder aus Mischungen auf der Grundlage von Gips zu Bauzwecken:\n  • Platten, Tafeln, Dielen, Fliesen und ähnliche Waren, nicht verziert"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- fabbricazione di articoli in gesso o di composizioni a base di gesso per l'edilizia:\n • tavole, lastre, pannelli, piastrelle e articoli simili, non ornati"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2363> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "2363" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of ready-mixed concrete"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de béton prêt à l’emploi"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Frischbeton, Transportbeton"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di calcestruzzo pronto per l’uso"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "236300" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of ready-mixed concrete"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2363> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication de béton prêt à l’emploi"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Frischbeton, Transportbeton"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Produzione di calcestruzzo pronto per l’uso"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of concrete ready to pour, i.e. to which water has already been added and which is usually transported in concrete mixer lorries"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- la fabrication de béton prêt à être coulé, c'est-à-dire auquel de l'eau a déjà été ajoutée et qui est généralement transporté dans des camions-bétonnières"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Frischbeton/Transportbeton, d. h. dem bereits Wasser hinzugefügt wurde und der üblicherweise in Betonmischfahrzeugen transportiert wird"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- produzione di calcestruzzo pronto per l'uso cioè già addizionato di acqua e trasportato solitamente in autobetoniere"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- manufacture of refractory cements, see 232000"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n\n- la fabrication de ciments réfractaires, voir 232000"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von feuerfesten Zementen, siehe 232000"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/236300/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di cementi refrattari, cfr. 232000"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2364> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "2364" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of mortars"@en ;
