    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- activities of foundries of light metal\n- manufacture of castings made of aluminium\n- manufacture of castings made of magnesium\n- manufacture of castings made of titanium"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les activités des fonderies de métaux légers\n- la fabrication de pièces coulées en aluminium\n- la fabrication de pièces coulées en magnésium\n- la fabrication de pièces coulées en titane"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Tätigkeiten von Leichtmetallgiessereien\n- Herstellung von Gussstücken aus Aluminium\n- Herstellung von Gussstücken aus Magnesium\n- Herstellung von Gussstücken aus Titan"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- attività delle fonderie di metalli leggeri \n- fusione di getti in alluminio\n- fusione di getti in magnesio\n- fusione di getti in titanio"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n- casting of dental implements, etc., of light metals"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- le coulage en métaux légers d'instruments dentaires, etc."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Giessen von zahnmedizinischen Instrumenten usw., aus Leichtmetallen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- fusione di strumenti dentali, eccetera, in altri metalli leggeri"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- casting of metals not considered light metals, see 245100, 245200, 245400"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- le coulage de métaux non considérés comme des métaux légers, voir 245100, 245200, 245400"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Giessen von Metallen, die nicht als Leichtmetalle gelten, siehe 245100, 245200, 245400"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/245300/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fusione di getti in metalli non considerati metalli leggeri, cfr. 245100, 245200, 245400"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2454> a skos:Concept ;
