<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "266000" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Manufacture of irradiation, electromedical and electrotherapeutic equipment"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/2660> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabrication d’équipements d’irradiation médicale, d’équipements électromédicaux et électrothérapeutiques"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Herstellung von Bestrahlungs- und Elektrotherapiegeräten und elektromedizinischen Geräten"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fabbricazione di apparecchiature per irradiazione, elettromedicali ed elettroterapeutiche"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of irradiation apparatus and tubes (e.g. industrial, medical diagnostic, medical therapeutic, research, scientific):\n • alpha, beta, gamma, X-ray or other radiation equipment\n- manufacture of computed tomography (CT) scanners\n- manufacture of positron emission tomography (PET) scanners\n- manufacture of magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) equipment\n- manufacture of medical ultrasound equipment\n- manufacture of electrocardiographs\n- manufacture of electromedical endoscopic equipment\n- manufacture of medical laser equipment\n- manufacture of artificial respiration or therapeutic respiration apparatus\n- manufacture of pacemakers\n- manufacture of hearing aids"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication d'appareils et de tubes d'irradiation, par ex. pour l'industrie, le diagnostic médical, la thérapie médicale, la recherche, la science :\n • équipements d'irradiation alpha, bêta, gamma, à rayons X ou autres\n- la fabrication de tomodensitomètres\n- la fabrication de scanners à émission de positrons (PET)\n- la fabrication d'appareils d'imagerie par résonance magnétique (IRM)\n- la fabrication d'appareils à ultrasons médicaux\n- la fabrication d'électrocardiographes\n- la fabrication de matériel d'endoscopie électromédicale\n- la fabrication d'appareils à laser médical\n- la fabrication d'appareils de respiration artificielle ou thérapeutique\n- la fabrication de stimulateurs cardiaques\n- la fabrication de prothèses auditives"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von Bestrahlungsgeräten und -röhren (z. B. industrielle, medizinisch-diagnostische, medizinisch-therapeutische, für Forschung und Wissenschaft):\n  • Alpha-, Beta-, Gamma-, Röntgenstrahlen- oder andere Bestrahlungsgeräte\n- Herstellung von Computertomographen\n- Herstellung von PET-Scannern (Positronen-Emissions-Tomographen)\n- Herstellung von Magnetresonanztomographiegeräten\n- Herstellung von medizinischen Ultraschallgeräten\n- Herstellung von Elektrokardiographen\n- Herstellung von elektromedizinischen Endoskopiegeräten\n- Herstellung von medizinischen Lasergeräten\n- Herstellung von Geräten zur künstlichen Beatmung oder von Atmungstherapie-Geräten\n- Herstellung von Herzschrittmachern\n- Herstellung von Hörgeräten"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- fabbricazione di apparecchiature e tubi per l'irradiazione (ad esempio per usi industriali, medico-diagnostici e terapeutici, per ricerca, per uso scientifico):\n • apparecchiature a raggi alfa, a raggi beta, a raggi gamma, a raggi X e altre attrezzature a raggi\n- fabbricazione di scanner TC\n- fabbricazione di scanner PET\n- fabbricazione di apparecchiature per risonanza magnetica (RMN)\n- fabbricazione di apparecchiature mediche a ultrasuoni\n- fabbricazione di elettrocardiografi\n- fabbricazione di apparecchiature mediche endoscopiche\n- fabbricazione di apparecchiature medicali laser\n- fabbricazione di dispositivi per la respirazione artificiale o per la respirazione terapeutica\n- fabbricazione di pacemaker\n- fabbricazione di apparecchi acustici (protesi uditive o audioprotesi)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- manufacture of food and milk irradiation equipment"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la fabrication de matériel d'irradiation des aliments et du lait"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Herstellung von Geräten zur Bestrahlung von Milch oder anderen Nahrungsmitteln"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- fabbricazione di apparecchiature per l'irradiazione di alimenti e latte"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of tanning beds, see 279000"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de lits de bronzage, voir 279000"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Sonnenbänken, siehe 279000"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/266000/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di lettini abbronzanti, cfr. 279000"@it .

