    skos:prefLabel "Costruzione di imbarcazioni da diporto e sportive"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "301200" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Building of pleasure and sporting boats"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/3012> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Construction de bateaux de plaisance"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Boots- und Yachtbau"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Costruzione di imbarcazioni da diporto e sportive"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- manufacture of inflatable boats and rafts for sports and recreation\n- building of sailing boats with or without auxiliary motor\n- building of motorboats\n- building of recreation-type hovercraft\n- building of yachts\n- manufacture of personal watercraft\n- manufacture of other pleasure and sporting boats, e.g.:\n • canoes, kayaks, rowing boats, skiffs"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fabrication de bateaux et de radeaux gonflables pour le sport et les loisirs\n- la construction de voiliers avec ou sans moteur auxiliaire\n- la construction de bateaux à moteur\n- la construction d'aéroglisseurs de loisir\n- la construction de yachts\n- la fabrication de véhicules nautiques à moteur\n- la construction d'autres bateaux de plaisance et de sport, par ex. :\n • canoës, kayaks, bateaux à rames, skiffs"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Herstellung von aufblasbaren Booten und Flössen für Sport und Erholung\n- Bau von Segelbooten mit oder ohne Hilfsmotor\n- Bau von Motorbooten\n- Bau von Luftkissenfahrzeugen für Freizeitzwecke\n- Bau von Yachten\n- Bau von Wassersportfahrzeugen\n- Bau von anderen Vergnügungs- und Sportbooten, z. B.:\n • Kanus, Kajaks, Ruderboote, Skiffs"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- fabbricazione di imbarcazioni gonfiabili (imbarcazioni pneumatiche) e gommoni da diporto e sportivi\n- costruzione di imbarcazioni a vela (barche a vela) con o senza motore ausiliario\n- costruzione di imbarcazioni a motore\n- costruzione di aeroscafi (hovercraft) cioè natanti a cuscino d'aria da diporto\n- costruzione di yacht\n- fabbricazione di moto d'acqua\n- fabbricazione di altre imbarcazioni da diporto e sportive, ad esempio:\n • canoe, kayak, barche a remi, skiff"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- factory conversion of pleasure and sporting boats"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la transformation en usine de bateaux de plaisance et de sport"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Werksumbau von Vergnügungs- und Sportbooten"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- conversione in fabbrica di imbarcazioni da diporto e sportive"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of parts of pleasure and sporting boats:\n • manufacture of sails, see 139600\n • manufacture of iron or steel anchors, see 259900\n • manufacture of marine engines, see 281100\n- factory overhaul of engines for sport/recreational ships and boats, see 281100\n- manufacture of sailboards and surfboards, see 323000\n- repair of pleasure boats, see 331500\n- rental of pleasure boats and sailing boats with crew, see 501000, 503000\n- rental of pleasure boats and yachts without crew, see 772100"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication d'éléments de bateaux de plaisance et de sport :\n • fabrication de voiles, voir 139600\n • fabrication d'ancres en fer ou en acier, voir 259900\n • fabrication de moteurs marins, voir 281100\n- la révision en usine de moteurs de bateaux de sport/plaisance, voir 281100\n- la fabrication de planches à voile et de planches de surf, voir 323000\n- la réparation de bateaux de plaisance, voir 331500\n- la location de bateaux de plaisance et de voiliers avec équipage, voir 501000, 503000\n- la location de bateaux de plaisance et de yachts sans équipage, voir 772100"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Teilen für Freizeit- und Sportboote:\n  • Herstellung von Segeln, siehe 139600\n  • Herstellung von Ankern aus Eisen oder Stahl, siehe 259900\n  • Herstellung von Schiffsmotoren, siehe 281100\n- Werksüberholung von Motoren für Sport- und Freizeitschiffe und -boote, siehe 281100\n- Herstellung von Segel- und Surfbrettern, siehe 323000\n- Reparatur von Vergnügungsschiffen, siehe 331500\n- Vermietung von Vergnügungsschiffen und Segelbooten mit Besatzung, siehe 501000, 503000\n- Vermietung von Vergnügungsschiffen und Yachten ohne Besatzung, siehe 772100"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301200/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di parti di imbarcazioni da diporto e sportive:\n • fabbricazione di vele, cfr. 139600\n • fabbricazione di ancore in ferro o acciaio, cfr. 259900\n •  fabbricazione di motori marini, cfr. 281100\n- revisione (factory overhaul) di motori per navi e imbarcazioni sportive e da diporto, cfr. 281100\n- fabbricazione di tavole a vela e tavole da surf, cfr. 323000\n- riparazione di imbarcazioni da diporto, cfr. 331500\n- noleggio di imbarcazioni da diporto e barche a vela con equipaggio, cfr. 501000, 503000\n- noleggio di imbarcazioni da diporto e yacht senza equipaggio, cfr. 772100"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/3013> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
