    skos:prefLabel "Bau von Kriegsschiffen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Costruzione di navi e imbarcazioni per scopi militari"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "301300" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Building of military ships and vessels"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/3013> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Construction de bateaux et navires militaires"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Bau von Kriegsschiffen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Costruzione di navi e imbarcazioni per scopi militari"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes the building of military ships and vessels, such as combat ships equipped with various offensive and defensive weapons and with protective devices against shelling, and the building of military floating structures, for example:\n- aircraft carriers\n- amphibious warfare and assault ships\n- cruisers\n- destroyers\n- submarines\n- landing crafts\n- tugs for transporting ammunition or mines"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend la construction de navires et de bateaux militaires tels que les navires de combat équipés de diverses armes offensives et défensives et de dispositifs de protection contre les bombardements, ainsi que la construction de structures militaires flottantes, par ex. :\n- porte-avions\n- navires de guerre et d'assaut amphibie\n- croiseurs\n- destroyers\n- sous-marins\n- bateaux de débarquement\n- remorqueurs pour le transport de munitions ou de mines"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst den Bau von militärischen Schiffen und Wasserfahrzeugen, wie Kampfschiffe, die mit verschiedenen Angriffs- und Verteidigungswaffen und mit Schutzvorrichtungen gegen Beschuss ausgestattet sind, sowie den Bau von schwimmenden militärischen Einrichtungen, z. B.:\n- Flugzeugträger\n- amphibische Kampf- und Angriffsschiffe\n- Kreuzer\n- Zerstörer\n- U-Boote\n- Landungsboote\n- Schlepper für den Transport von Munition oder Minen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include la costruzione di navi e imbarcazioni militari, ad esempio navi da combattimento dotate di varie armi offensive e difensive e di dispositivi di protezione contro i bombardamenti, e la costruzione di strutture galleggianti per uso militare ad esempio:\n- portaerei\n- navi anfibie da guerra e d'assalto\n- incrociatori\n- cacciatorpedinieri\n- sottomarini\n- mezzi da sbarco\n- rimorchiatori per il trasporto di munizioni o mine"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- factory conversion of military ships, vessels and floating structures"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- la conversion en usine de navires militaires, de bateaux et de structures flottantes"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Werksumbau von militärischen Schiffen, Wasserfahrzeugen und schwimmenden Anlagen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- riconversione di navi, imbarcazioni e strutture galleggianti per uso militare"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- manufacture of weapons and ammunition (e.g. torpedo tubes, torpedoes), see 253000\n- factory overhaul of military ship and vessel engines, see 281100\n- building of civilian ships and floating structures, see 301100\n- manufacture of inflatable boats or rafts for pleasure and sport, see 301200"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication d'armes et de munitions (par ex. tubes lance-torpilles, torpilles), voir 253000\n- la révision en usine de moteurs de navires et de bateaux militaires, voir 281100\n- la construction de navires civils et de structures flottantes, voir 301100\n- la fabrication de bateaux ou de radeaux gonflables pour la plaisance et le sport, voir 301200"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Waffen und Munition (z. B. Torpedorohre, Torpedos), siehe 253000\n- Werksüberholung von militärischen Schiffs- und Wasserfahrzeugmotoren, siehe 281100\n- Bau von zivilen Schiffen und schwimmenden Vorrichtungen, siehe 301100\n- Herstellung von Schlauchbooten und Flössen für Freizeit und Sport, siehe 301200"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/301300/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di armi e munizioni, ad esempio tubi lanciasiluri, siluri, cfr. 253000\n- revisione (factory overhaul) di motori per navi e imbarcazioni militari, cfr. 281100\n- costruzione di navi e di strutture galleggianti per scopi civili, cfr. 301100\n- fabbricazione di imbarcazioni gonfiabili (imbarcazioni pneumatiche) o gommoni da diporto e sportivi, cfr. 301200"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/302> a skos:Concept ;
