<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434202/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- erection and dismantling of scaffolds and work platform"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434202/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- le montage et le démontage d'échafaudages et de plates-formes de travail"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434202/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
