<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434202/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- montaggio e smontaggio di ponteggi e piattaforme di lavoro"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434202/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- renting of scaffolds and work platforms, see 773200"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434202/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n\n- la location d'échafaudages et de plates-formes de travail, voir 773200"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434202/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Vermietung von Gerüsten und Arbeitsbühnen, siehe 773200"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434202/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- noleggio di ponteggi e piattaforme di lavoro, cfr. 773200"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434203> a skos:Concept ;
