<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434203/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- stove and chimney installation\n\n- chimney lining"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434203/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- l'installation de poêles et de cheminées\n- le tubage de cheminée"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434203/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Einbau von Öfen und Kaminen\n- Kaminauskleidung"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/434203/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- costruzione di camini e forni industriali"@it .

