<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/461200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes the activities of agents involved in the wholesale of:\n\n- fuels, ores, metals and industrial chemicals, including fertilisers"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/461200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend les activités des agents impliqués dans le commerce de gros de :\n\n- combustibles, minerais, métaux et produits chimiques industriels, y compris les engrais"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/461200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
