    skos:prefLabel "Grosshandel mit Milch, Milcherzeugnissen, Eiern, Speiseölen und Nahrungsfetten"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Commercio all'ingrosso di prodotti lattiero-caseari, uova, oli e grassi alimentari"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "463300" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Wholesale of dairy products, eggs and edible oils and fats"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/4633> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Commerce de gros de produits laitiers, œufs, huiles et matières grasses comestibles"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Grosshandel mit Milch, Milcherzeugnissen, Eiern, Speiseölen und Nahrungsfetten"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Commercio all'ingrosso di prodotti lattiero-caseari, uova, oli e grassi alimentari"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/additionalContentNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- wholesale of dairy products\n\n- wholesale of eggs and egg products\n\n- wholesale of edible oils and fats of animal or vegetable origin"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- le commerce de gros de produits laitiers\n- le commerce de gros d'œufs et d'ovoproduits\n- le commerce de gros d'huiles et de graisses d'origine animale ou végétale comestibles"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Grosshandel mit Milch und Milcherzeugnissen\n- Grosshandel mit Eiern und Eiprodukten\n- Grosshandel mit tierischen oder pflanzlichen Speiseölen und Nahrungsfetten"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- commercio all'ingrosso di prodotti lattiero-caseari\n- commercio all'ingrosso di uova e prodotti a base di uova\n- commercio all'ingrosso di oli e grassi alimentari di origine animale o vegetale"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- wholesale of powdered milk\n\n- wholesale of ice creams and sorbets"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- le commerce de gros de lait en poudre\n- le commerce de gros de crèmes glacées et de sorbets"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Grosshandel mit Milchpulver\n- Grosshandel mit Speiseeis/Glacen und Sorbets"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463300/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- commercio all'ingrosso di latte in polvere\n- commercio all'ingrosso di gelati e sorbetti"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/4634> a skos:Concept ;
