<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463600/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- wholesale of sugar, including sugar cubes, molasses, sugar confectionery and chocolate\n- wholesale of bakery products"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463600/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- le commerce de gros du sucre, y compris le sucre en morceaux, les mélasses, la confiserie de sucre et le chocolat\n- le commerce de gros des produits de boulangerie"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463600/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Grosshandel mit Zucker, einschliesslich Würfelzucker, Melasse, Konfekt und Schokolade\n- Grosshandel mit Backwaren"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463600/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- commercio all'ingrosso di zucchero, incluso zucchero in cubetti, melassa, dolciumi e cioccolato\n- commercio all'ingrosso di prodotti da forno"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463600/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- wholesale of ice cream, see 463300"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463600/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- le commerce de gros de glaces, voir 463300"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463600/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Grosshandel mit Speiseeis/Glacen, siehe 463300"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/463600/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- commercio all'ingrosso di gelati, cfr. 463300"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/4637> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "4637" ;
