    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/466200/note/additionalContentNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/466200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- wholesale of machine tools of any type and for any material"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/466200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- le commerce de gros de machines-outils de tous types et pour tous matériaux"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/466200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Grosshandel mit Werkzeugmaschinen jeder Art und für jedes Material"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/466200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- commercio all'ingrosso di macchine utensili di qualsiasi tipo e per qualsiasi materiale"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/466200/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- wholesale of computer-controlled machine tools"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/466200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- le commerce de gros de machines-outils commandées par ordinateur"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/466200/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Grosshandel mit computergesteuerten Werkzeugmaschinen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/466200/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- commercio all'ingrosso di macchine utensili a controllo computerizzato"@it .

