<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- retail sale of meat and meat products, including poultry and game\n\n- retail sale of tripe, delicatessen (charcuterie), salted meat"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- le commerce de détail de viande et de produits à base de viande, y compris la volaille et le gibier\n\n- le commerce de détail de tripes, de charcuterie et de viande salée"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Einzelhandel mit Fleisch und Fleischwaren, einschliesslich Geflügel und Wild\n- Einzelhandel mit Kutteln, Feinkost (Charcuterie), Pökelfleisch/Surfleisch"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- commercio al dettaglio di carni e di prodotti a base di carne, incluse carni di pollame e selvaggina\n- commercio al dettaglio di trippa, salumi e carne salata"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472200/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- retail sale of snails"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- le commerce de détail d'escargots"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472200/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Einzelhandel mit Schnecken"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472200/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- commercio al dettaglio di lumache"@it .

