<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472300/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- retail sale of fish, seafood, seafood products and preparations thereof"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472300/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- le commerce de détail de poissons, de fruits de mer, de produits de la mer et de leurs préparations"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472300/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Einzelhandel mit Fisch, Meeresfrüchten, Meeresfrüchteprodukten und Zubereitungen daraus"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472300/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- commercio al dettaglio di pesce, frutti di mare, prodotti ittici e preparazioni a base di pesce"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472300/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- retail sale of algae and seaweed"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- le commerce de détail d'algues et goémons"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472300/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Einzelhandel mit Algen und Seetang"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/472300/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- commercio al dettaglio di alghe e macroalghe marine"@it .

