<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/477401/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- activities of opticians\n\n- retail sale of corrective glasses, lenses and sunglasses"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/477401/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- les activités des opticiens\n\n- le commerce de détail de lunettes, lentilles et lunettes de soleil correctrices"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/477401/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Tätigkeiten von Optikern\n- Einzelhandel mit Brillen, Kontaktlinsen und Sonnenbrillen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/477401/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- attività di ottici\n- commercio al dettaglio di occhiali, lenti e occhiali da sole correttivi"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/477401/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
