<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/477700/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Einzelhandel mit Silberwaren"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/477700/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- commercio al dettaglio di articoli di argenteria"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/477700/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- retail sale of imitation jewellery, see 477800"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/477700/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- le commerce de détail de bijoux fantaisie, voir 477800"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/477700/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Einzelhandel mit Modeschmuck, siehe 477800"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/477700/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- commercio al dettaglio di bigiotteria, cfr. 477800"@it .

