    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/493900/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/493900/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- bicycle taxi services\n- passenger road transport by vehicles drawn by humans or animals"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/493900/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les services de vélo-taxi\n- le transport routier de passagers par des véhicules à traction humaine ou animale"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/493900/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Fahrradtaxidienste\n- Personenbeförderung im Strassenverkehr mit von Menschen oder Tieren gezogenen Fahrzeugen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/493900/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- trasporto su taxi in bicicletta\n- trasporto di passeggeri mediante veicoli trainati da persone o animali"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/493900/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- patient transport by ambulance, see 869200\n- transport of human remains, see 963000"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/493900/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- le transport de patient en ambulance, voir 869200\n- le transport de restes humains, voir 963000"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/493900/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Krankentransporte, siehe 869200\n- Beförderung von menschlichen Überresten, siehe 963000"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/493900/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- trasporto in ambulanza, cfr. 869200\n- trasporto di salme, ceneri o resti umani, cfr. 963000"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/494> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
