<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/494200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- removal (relocation) services to businesses and households by road transport"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/494200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les services de déménagement (relocation) aux entreprises et aux ménages par transport routier"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/494200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Umzugstransporte für Unternehmen und Haushalte im Strassenverkehr"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/494200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- servizi di trasloco (relocation) per imprese, altre organizzazioni o famiglie effettuati mediante trasporto su strada"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/494200/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n- leasing of removal vehicles with a driver\n- storage of furniture as part of the removal service"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/494200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- la location d'un véhicule de déménagement avec un chauffeur\n- le stockage du mobilier dans le cadre du service de déménagement"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/494200/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Leasing von Umzugsfahrzeugen mit Fahrer\n- Lagerung von Möbeln als Bestandteil eines Umzugtransports"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/494200/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- noleggio di veicoli per trasloco con conducente\n- gestione di depositi per mobili connessa a servizi di trasloco"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/495> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "495" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Transport via pipeline"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/49> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Transport par conduites"@fr ;
