    skos:prefLabel "Campingplätze"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Servizi di aree di campeggio e aree attrezzate per veicoli ricreazionali"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "553000" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Camping grounds and recreational vehicle parks"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/5530> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Terrains de camping et parcs pour caravanes ou véhicules de loisirs"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Campingplätze"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Servizi di aree di campeggio e aree attrezzate per veicoli ricreazionali"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- provision of short-term accommodation in camping grounds (e.g. recreational camps, fishing and hunting camps)\n- provision of space and facilities for recreational vehicles"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la fourniture d'un hébergement de courte durée dans des terrains de camping (par ex. des camps de loisirs, des camps de pêche et de chasse)\n- la fourniture d'espace et d'installations pour les véhicules de loisirs"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Bereitstellung von kurzzeitigen Unterkünften auf Campingplätzen (z. B. in Freizeitcamps, Camps für Fischer und Jäger)\n- Bereitstellung von Stellplätzen und Einrichtungen für Wohnmobile"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- servizi di alloggio di breve durata in campeggi, ad esempio campi ricreativi, campi per la pesca e la caccia\n- attività di fornitura di spazi e servizi complementari per veicoli ricreazionali (veicoli da diporto)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- glamping accommodation\n\n- accommodation provided by protective shelters or plain bivouac facilities"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- les hébergements de type \"glamping\"\n- l'hébergement fourni par des refuges ou des installations de bivouac ordinaire"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Glamping-Unterkünfte\n- Unterkünfte in Schutzhütten oder einfachen Biwakeinrichtungen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- alloggi glamping (campeggi di lusso)\n- sistemazione in ripari protettivi o in semplici strutture di bivacco"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- intermediation service activities for accommodation, see 554000"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- les activités de service d'intermédiation pour l'hébergement, voir 554000"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Vermittlungsdienste für Unterkünfte, siehe 554000"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/553000/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- attività di servizi di intermediazione per servizi di alloggio, cfr. 554000"@it .

