    skos:prefLabel "Autres activités de service d’information"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Erbringung von sonstigen Informationsdienstleistungen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Altre attività dei servizi di informazione"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "639200" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Other information service activities"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/6392> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Autres activités de service d’information"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Erbringung von sonstigen Informationsdienstleistungen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Altre attività dei servizi di informazione"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- other information service activities not elsewhere classified, e.g.:\n • information search services on a contract or fee basis (e.g. by web scraping)\n • news clipping services, press clipping services\n • compiling of information or directories on a fee or contract basis"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les autres activités de services d'information non classées ailleurs, par ex. :\n • services de recherche d'informations sur la base d'un contrat ou d'une rémunération (par ex. par le biais de l'extraction de données sur le web)\n • services de coupures de presse\n • compilation d'informations ou d'annuaires sur la base d'une rémunération ou d'un contrat"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Erbringung sonstiger, anderweitig nicht genannter Informationsdienstleistungen, z. B.:\n  • Informationsvermittlung gegen Entgelt oder auf sonstiger vertraglicher Grundlage (z. B. durch Web Scraping / automatisiertes Auslesen von Webseiten-Inhalten)\n  • Nachrichten- und Zeitungsausschnittdienste\n  • Zusammenstellung von Informationen oder Verzeichnissen gegen Entgelt oder auf sonstiger vertraglicher Grundlage"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- altre attività di servizi di informazione non classificate altrove, ad esempio: \n • servizi di ricerca di informazioni su base remunerativa o contrattuale (per conto terzi), ad esempio tramite webscraping \n • attività di rassegna stampa \n • compilazione di informazioni o elenchi su base remunerativa o contrattuale (per conto terzi)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/639200/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- intermediation service activities for specialised construction services, see 436000\n- intermediation service activities for retail sale, see 479\n- intermediation service activities for transport, see 523\n- intermediation service activities for postal and courier activities, see 533000\n- intermediation service activities for accommodation, see 554000\n- intermediation service activities for food and beverage service activities, see 564000\n- publishing activities, see division 58\n- broadcasting activities, see division 60\n- news syndicate and news agency activities, see 603100\n- intermediation service activities for telecommunication, see 612000\n- intermediation service activities for real estate activities, see 683100\n- intermediation service activities for the rental and leasing of tangible goods and non-financial intangible assets, see 775\n- activities of call centres, see 822000\n- intermediation service activities for business support service activities n.e.c., see 824000\n- intermediation service activities for courses and tutors, see 856100\n- intermediation service activities for medical, dental and other human health services, see 869700\n- intermediation service activities for residential care activities, see 879100\n- intermediation service activities for the repair and maintenance of computers, personal and household goods, and motor vehicles and motorcycles, see 954000\n- intermediation service activities for personal services, see 964000"@en .

