<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "652000" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Reinsurance"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/6520> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Réassurance"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Rückversicherungen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Riassicurazioni"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/additionalContentNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- activities of assuming all or part of the risk associated with existing insurance policies originally underwritten by other insurance providers"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les activités consistant à prendre à son compte la totalité ou une partie du risque associé à des polices d’assurance émises par d’autres assureurs."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Tätigkeiten der Übernahme des gesamten oder eines Teils des Risikos im Zusammenhang mit bestehenden Versicherungsverträgen, die ursprünglich von anderen Versicherungsanbietern gezeichnet wurden"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- attività di assunzione di tutto o parte del rischio associato a polizze assicurative esistenti originariamente sottoscritte da altri assicuratori (compagnie di assicurazione)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- activities of finite reinsurance"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- les activités de réassurance limitées"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Tätigkeiten der Finanzrückversicherung"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/652000/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- attività di riassicurazione finite"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/653> a skos:Concept ;
