    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/691002/note/additionalContentNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/691002/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- activities of legal advice by persons who are not members of the bar"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/691002/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les activités de conseils juridiques donnés par des personnes qui ne sont pas membres du barreau"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/691002/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Rechtsberatung durch Personen, die keiner Anwaltskammer angehören"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/691002/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- attività di consulenza legale da parte di persone non iscritte all'ordine degli avvocati"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/691002/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n- activities of appointed legal guardians, without provision of residential care"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/691002/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- les activités des tuteurs légaux désignés, sans fourniture de soins résidentiels"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/691002/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Tätigkeiten von bestellten gesetzlichen Vormündern, ohne Bereitstellung von Pflegeplätzen"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/691002/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- attività di tutori legali nominati, senza fornitura di assistenza residenziale"@it .

