<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773400/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- rental and operating leasing of water transport equipment without an operator:\n • commercial boats, ships and hovercraft"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773400/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la location et le location-bail de matériel de transport par eau sans un équipage :\n • bateaux commerciaux, navires et aéroglisseurs"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773400/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Vermietung und Operating-Leasing von Wasserfahrzeugen ohne Bedienungspersonal:\n  • Handelsschiffe, Boote und Luftkissenfahrzeuge"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773400/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- noleggio e leasing operativo di mezzi di trasporto marittimi, fluviali e lacustri senza operatore o equipaggio:\n • imbarcazioni, navi e aeroscafi o hovercraft non da diporto"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773400/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- rental of water-transport equipment with operator, see division 50\n- rental of pleasure boats without an operator, see 772100"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773400/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la location de matériels de transport maritime et fluvial avec équipage, voir division 50\n- la location de bateaux de plaisance sans un équipage, voir 772100"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773400/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Vermietung von Wasserfahrzeugen mit Bedienungspersonal, siehe Abteilung 50\n- Vermietung von Vergnügungsboote ohne Bedienungspersonal, siehe 772100"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773400/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- noleggio di mezzi di trasporto marittimo, fluviale e lacustre con operatore, cfr. divisione 50\n- noleggio di imbarcazioni da diporto senza operatore, cfr. 772100"@it .

