<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773500/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- rental and operating leasing of air transport equipment without an operator:\n • airplanes\n • hot air balloons\n • helicopters"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773500/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la location et le location-bail de matériel de transport aérien sans un pilote :\n • avions\n • ballons à air chaud\n • hélicoptères"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773500/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Vermietung und Operating-Leasing von Luftfahrzeugen ohne Bedienungspersonal:\n  • Flugzeuge\n  • Heissluftballons\n  • Hubschrauber"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773500/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- noleggio e leasing operativo di mezzi di trasporto aerei senza operatore o equipaggio:\n • aeroplani\n • mongolfiere (palloni aerostatici)\n • elicotteri"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773500/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- rental of air transport equipment with an operator, see division 51"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773500/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la location de matériel de transport aérien avec pilote, voir division 51"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773500/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Vermietung von Luftfahrzeugen mit Bedienungspersonal, siehe Abteilung 51"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/773500/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- noleggio di mezzi per il trasporto aereo con operatore, cfr. divisione 51"@it .

