<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/855901/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- language instruction and conversational skills instruction"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/855901/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les cours de langues et de compétences conversationnelles"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/855901/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Sprach- und Konversationskurse"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/855901/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- corsi di lingua e conversazione"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/855901/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n- public speaking training"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/855901/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- la formation à la prise de parole en public"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/855901/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Rhetorikkurse"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/855901/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- corsi di comunicazione efficace per parlare in pubblico"@it .

