    skos:prefLabel "Activités de soins dentaires"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Zahnarztpraxen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Attività odontoiatriche"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "862300" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Dental practice care activities"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8623> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Activités de soins dentaires"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Zahnarztpraxen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Attività odontoiatriche"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- dental practice activities of a general or specialised nature (e.g. dentistry, endodontic and paediatric dentistry); oral pathology\n- orthodontic activities"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les activités de pratique dentaire de nature générale ou spécialisée (par ex. dentisterie, endodontique et la dentisterie pédiatrique); pathologie orale\n- les activités d’orthodontie"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Tätigkeiten von Zahnarztpraxen allgemeiner oder spezieller Natur (z. B. allgemeine Zahnheilkunde, endodontische und pädiatrische Zahnheilkunde); Oralpathologie\n- Kieferorthopädie"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- cure odontoiatriche di natura generica o specialistica, ad esempio odontoiatria, endodonzia e odontoiatria pediatrica; trattamento delle patologie del cavo orale\n- attività ortodontiche"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- dental activities in operating rooms"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- les activités de pratique dentaire en salles d’opération"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Kieferchirurgie"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- attività odontoiatriche svolte in sale operatorie"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- production of artificial teeth, denture and prosthetic appliances by dental laboratories, see 325002\n- inpatient hospital activities, see 8610\n- activities of dental paramedical personnel (e.g. dental hygienists, dental therapists) see 869909"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- la fabrication de dents artificielles, de dentiers et de prothèses par des laboratoires dentaires, voir 325002\n- les activités de soins hospitaliers, voir 8610\n- les activités du personnel paramédical dans le domaine des soins dentaires (par ex. hygiénistes dentaires, spécialistes en thérapie dentaire), voir 869909"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Herstellung von Zahnersatz durch Zahntechniker, siehe 325002\n- stationäre Behandlung in Krankenhäusern, siehe 8610\n- Tätigkeiten von zahnmedizinischem Hilfspersonal (z. B. Dentalhygieniker, Zahntherapeuten), siehe 869909"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/862300/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- fabbricazione di denti artificiali, dentiere e protesi dentarie da parte di laboratori odontotecnici, cfr. 325002\n- attività ospedaliere in regime di ricovero, cfr. 8610\n- attività del personale paramedico odontoiatrico, ad esempio terapisti e igienisti dentali, cfr. 869909"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "869" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Other human health activities"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/86> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Autres activités pour la santé humaine"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Sonstiges Gesundheitswesen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Altre attività per la salute umana"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869/note/inclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This group includes medical, curative, rehabilitative, or prevention activities (without the provision of accommodation services) by paramedical practitioners and health professionals other than hospitals or practicing medical doctors."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce groupe comprend les activités médicales, curatives, de rééducation ou de prévention (sans la fourniture de services d’hébergement) exercées par des praticiens paramédicaux et des professionnels de la santé autres que les hôpitaux ou les médecins."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Gruppe umfasst medizinische, heilende, rehabilitative oder präventive Tätigkeiten (ohne Beherbergungsleistungen), die nicht in Krankenhäusern oder von Ärzten, sondern von Angehörigen der Gesundheitsfachberufe ausgeübt werden."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo gruppo include attività mediche, curative, riabilitative o di prevenzione (senza fornitura di servizi residenziali) fornite da personale paramedico e sanitario non erogate da ospedali o medici praticanti."@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8691> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "8691" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Diagnostic imaging services and medical laboratory activities"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Activités d’imagerie médicale et de laboratoire d’analyse médicale"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Erbringung von Dienstleistungen der diagnostischen Bildgebung sowie von medizinischen Laboratorien"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Attività di diagnostica per immagini e di laboratorio medico"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8691/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8691/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8691/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8691/note/inclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8691/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This class includes activities of medical laboratories providing analytic or diagnostic services (without the medical analysis or interpretation itself), including body fluid analysis or genetic testing, directly to outpatients with or without referral from healthcare practitioners."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8691/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Cette classe comprend les activités des laboratoires médicaux fournissant des services d'analyse ou de diagnostic (sans l'analyse ou l'interprétation médicale elle-même), y compris l'analyse des liquides corporels ou les tests génétiques, directement aux patients ambulatoires envoyés ou non par des professionnels de la santé."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8691/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Klasse umfasst die Tätigkeiten medizinischer Laboratorien, die analytische oder diagnostische Dienstleistungen erbringen (ohne die eigentliche medizinische Analyse oder Interpretation), einschliesslich der Analyse von Körperflüssigkeiten oder Gentests, direkt für ambulante Patienten mit oder ohne Überweisung durch Ärzte."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8691/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questa classe include le attività dei laboratori medici che forniscono analisi cliniche o servizi diagnostici (senza l'analisi o l'interpretazione medica vera e propria), inclusa l'analisi dei fluidi corporei o i test genetici, erogate direttamente a pazienti ambulatoriali con o senza la prescrizione medica da parte di operatori sanitari."@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "869101" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Diagnostic imaging services"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8691> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Activités d'imagerie médicale"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Dienstleistungen der diagnostischen Bildgebung"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Servizi di diagnostica per immagini"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- X-ray laboratories and other diagnostic imaging centres"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les laboratoires de radiologie et autres centres d'imagerie médicale"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Röntgeninstitute und andere Zentren für diagnostische Bildgebung"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- laboratori di radiografia e altri centri di diagnostica per immagini"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- medical analysis and interpretation of diagnostic medical images (x-ray, electrocardiograms, endoscopies, etc.), see 862200"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- l'analyse médicale et l'interprétation d'images médicales diagnostiques (radiographie, électrocardiogrammes, endoscopies, etc.), voir 862200"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- medizinische Analyse und Interpretation diagnostischer Bilder (Röntgen, Elektrokardiogramme, Endoskopien usw.), siehe 862200"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869101/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- analisi e interpretazione di immagini medico-diagnostiche (radiografie, elettrocardiogrammi, endoscopie, eccetera), cfr. 862200"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "869102" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Medical laboratory activities"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8691> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Activités de laboratoire médical"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Medizinische Labortätigkeiten"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Attività di laboratorio medico"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- blood analysis laboratories\n\n- DNA sequencing for ruling out or curing a specific disease"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les laboratoires d’analyses sanguines\n- le séquençage de l'ADN pour exclure ou guérir une maladie spécifique"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Blutanalyselaboratorien\n- DNA-Sequenzierung zum Ausschluss oder zur Heilung einer bestimmten Krankheit"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- laboratori di analisi del sangue\n- sequenziamento del DNA per escludere o curare una malattia specifica"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- laboratory doping control activities"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- les activités de contrôle du dopage en laboratoire"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Labortätigkeiten zur Dopingkontrolle"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- attività di controllo del doping in laboratorio"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- non-medical laboratory testing, testing activities in the field of food hygiene, activities of forensic laboratories, see 712000\n- activities of genome data centres, blood and organ banks, see 869909"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- les tests non médicaux en laboratoires, les tests dans le domaine de l’hygiène alimentaire, les activités des laboratoires médico-légaux, voir 712000\n- les activités des centres de données génomiques, des banques de sang et d'organes, voir 869909"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- nichtmedizinische Laboruntersuchungen, Untersuchungen auf dem Gebiet der Lebensmittelhygiene, Tätigkeiten forensischer Laboratorien, siehe 712000\n- Tätigkeiten von Genomdatenzentren, Blutbanken und Einrichtungen für Organspenden, siehe 869909"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869102/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- test di laboratorio non medici, controlli nel campo dell'igiene alimentare, attività di laboratori forensi, cfr. 712000\n- attività delle banche dati genetiche o del sangue e degli organi, cfr. 869909"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8692> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "8692" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Patient transportation by ambulance"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Transport de patients par ambulance"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Rettungs- und Krankentransportdienste"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Trasporto di pazienti in ambulanza"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "869200" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Patient transportation by ambulance"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8692> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Transport de patients par ambulance"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Rettungs- und Krankentransportdienste"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Trasporto di pazienti in ambulanza"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes ambulance transport of patients by any mode of transport, including airplanes. Ambulance vehicles carry paramedics / medical doctors and are usually equipped with lifesaving equipment."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend le transport par ambulance de patients par tout mode de transport, y compris l’avion. Les ambulances transportent du personnel paramédical/médical et sont généralement équipées d’équipement de sauvetage."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst Rettungsdienste und Krankentransport jeder Art, einschliesslich in Flugzeugen. Die Krankenwagen sind mit Rettungssanitätern / Ärzten besetzt und in der Regel mit lebensrettenden Geräten ausgestattet."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include il trasporto di pazienti in ambulanza con qualsiasi mezzo di trasporto, incluso il trasporto aereo. Nelle ambulanze, solitamente dotate di attrezzature salvavita, è presente personale medico e/o paramedico."@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n- specialised transport of patients, accompanied by paramedics\n- primary care given by a paramedic or a doctor during the patient’s transport by ambulance"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- le transport spécialisé de patients, accompagné de personnel paramédical\n- les soins primaires dispensés par un auxiliaire paramédical ou un médecin pendant le transport en ambulance"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Spezialtransporte von Patienten in Begleitung von Rettungssanitätern\n- Erstversorgung durch einen Rettungssanitäter oder Arzt während des Krankentransports"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- trasporto specializzato di pazienti accompagnati da personale paramedico\n- assistenza primaria fornita da personale paramedico o medico durante il trasporto in ambulanza"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- transport of patients, in vehicles without paramedical practitioners and equipment for lifesaving, see divisions 49, 50\n- transport of patients, in airplanes without paramedical practitioners and equipment for lifesaving, see division 51\n- transport of blood and body organs/fluids, see 869909"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- le transport de patients dans des véhicules sans personnel paramédical ni équipement de sauvetage, voir divisions 49 et 50\n- le transport de patients, en avion, sans personnel paramédical ni équipement de sauvetage, voir division 51\n- le transport de sang et d'organes/fluides corporels, voir 869909"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Krankentransporte in Fahrzeugen ohne Sanitätspersonal und ohne lebensrettende Ausrüstung, siehe Abteilungen 49, 50\n- Krankentransporte in Flugzeugen ohne Sanitätspersonal und ohne lebensrettende Ausrüstung, siehe Abteilung 51\n- Transport von Blut und Körperorganen/-flüssigkeiten, siehe 869909"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869200/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- trasporto di pazienti in veicoli senza personale paramedico e non dotati di attrezzature salvavita, cfr. divisioni 49, 50\n- trasporto di pazienti in aerei senza personale paramedico e non dotati di attrezzature salvavita, cfr. divisione 51\n- trasporto di sangue, organi e fluidi corporei, cfr. 869909"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8693> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "8693" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Activities of psychologists and psychotherapists, except medical doctors"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Activités des psychologues et psychothérapeutes, à l’exception des médecins"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Erbringung von Dienstleistungen von Psychotherapeutinnen und -therapeuten, klinischen und Gesundheitspsychologinnen und -psychologen, ohne ärztliche Therapien"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Attività di psicologi e psicoterapeuti, esclusi i medici"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "869301" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Activities of psychological psychotherapists"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8693> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Activités des psychologues-psychothérapeutes"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Aktivitäten von psychologischen Psychotherapeuten/innen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Attività di psicologi psicoterapeuti"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/additionalContentNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- consultation and treatment activities of psychological psychotherapists"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les activités de consultation et de traitement des psychologues-psychothérapeutes"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Konsultation und Behandlung von psychologischen Psychotherapeuten"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- attività di consulenza e trattamento effettuati da psicoterapeuti"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- music therapy activities performed by psychotherapists"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- les activités de musicothérapie réalisées par des psychothérapeutes"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- musiktherapeutische Tätigkeiten, die von Psychotherapeuten durchgeführt werden"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- attività di musicoterapia effettuate da psicoterapeuti"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- activities of psychiatrists, see 862200\n- activities of psychologists without specialization in psychotherapy, see 869303"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n- les activités des psychiatres, voir 862200\n- les activités des psychologues sans spécialisation en psychothérapie, voir 869303"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Tätigkeiten von Psychiatern, siehe 862200\n- Tätigkeiten von Psychologen ohne Spezialisierung in Psychotherapie, siehe 869303"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869301/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- attività di medici psichiatri, cfr. 862200\n- attività di psicologi senza specializzazione in psicoterapia, cfr. 869303"@it .

