    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/additionalContentNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- consultation and treatment activities of psychologists in the fields of clinical psychology, health psychology and child and adolescent psychology"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n\n- les activités de consultation et de traitement des psychologues dans les domaines de la psychologie clinique, de la psychologie de la santé et de la psychologie de l'enfant et de l'adolescent"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Konsultation und Behandlung von Psychologen in den Bereichen klinische Psychologie, Gesundheitspsychologie sowie Kinder- und Jugendpsychologie"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- attività di consulenza e trattamento effettuati da psicologi, ad esempio psicologi clinici, psicologi della salute dell'infanzia e dell'adolescenza"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n\n- music therapy activities performed by psychologists"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n\n- les activités de musicothérapie réalisées par des psychologues"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- musiktherapeutische Tätigkeiten, die von Psychologen durchgeführt werden"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869303/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- attività di musicoterapia effettuate da psicologi"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/8694> a skos:Concept ;
