<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n\n- activities of independent nurses, who work in own consulting rooms or at patients’ homes"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les activités des infirmières et infirmiers indépendants qui travaillent dans leur propre cabinet de consultation ou au domicile des patients"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Tätigkeiten von selbstständigen Krankenpflegern, in eigenen Behandlungsräumen oder am Wohnort des Patienten"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- attività infermieristiche delle infermiere e degli infermieri indipendenti che lavorano nei propri ambulatori o a casa dei pazienti"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type also includes:\n- palliative nursing care activities for outpatients"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend également :\n- les activités de soins infirmiers palliatifs ambulatoires"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst ferner:\n- Palliativpflege für ambulante Patienten"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include inoltre:\n- attività di assistenza infermieristica palliativa per pazienti ambulatoriali"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n- residential nursing care facilities, see 871000\n- homecare services, see 881000"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n\n- les établissements de soins infirmiers résidentiels, voir 871000\n\n- les services de soins à domicile, voir 881000"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Tätigkeiten stationärer Pflegeeinrichtungen, siehe 871000\n- häusliche Pflegedienste, siehe 881000"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/869401/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- attività di strutture di assistenza infermieristica residenziale, cfr. 871000\n- servizi di assistenza domiciliare, cfr. 881000"@it .

