<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/952/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This group includes the repair and maintenance of personal and household goods."@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/952/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce groupe comprend la réparation et l'entretien des biens personnels et domestiques."@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/952/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Gruppe umfasst die Reparatur und Wartung von Gebrauchsgütern."@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/952/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo gruppo include la riparazione e la manutenzione di beni personali e domestici."@it .

