<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953102/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- bodywork repair\n- spraying and painting"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953102/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la réparation de la carrosserie\n- la peinture de véhicules automobiles"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953102/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Karosseriereparaturen\n- Spritz- und Lackierarbeiten"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953102/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- riparazione del rivestimento esterno di autoveicoli\n- spruzzatura e verniciatura"@it .

