<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953200/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- repair and maintenance of motorcycles\n- motorcycle and motorcycle parts spraying and painting activities\n- bodywork repair on motorcycles\n- washing, polishing, etc., of motorcycles"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953200/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- la réparation et l'entretien de motocycles\n- la peinture de motocycles et de pièces de motocycles\n- la réparation de carrosseries de motocycles\n- le lavage, le polissage, etc., de motocycles"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953200/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Reparatur und Wartung von Krafträdern\n- Spritz- und Lackierarbeiten an Krafträdern und Teilen für Krafträder\n- Karosseriereparaturen an Krafträdern\n- Waschen, Polieren usw. von Krafträdern"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953200/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- riparazione e manutenzione di motocicli\n- spruzzatura e verniciatura di motocicli e parti di motocicli\n- riparazione di carrozzerie di motocicli\n- lavaggio di motocicli, lucidatura di motocicli, eccetera"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953200/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- repair and maintenance of bicycles and electric bicycles, see 952900"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953200/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n\n- la réparation et l'entretien des bicyclettes et des bicyclettes électriques, voir 952900"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953200/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Reparatur und Instandhaltung von Fahrrädern und Elektrofahrrädern, siehe 952900"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/953200/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- riparazione e manutenzione di biciclette e biciclette elettriche, cfr. 952900"@it .

