<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "9900" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Activities of extraterritorial organisations and bodies"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Activités des organisations et organismes extraterritoriaux"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Exterritoriale Organisationen und Körperschaften"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Attività di organizzazioni ed organismi extraterritoriali"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/additionalContentNote> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/additionalContentNote/fr> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/additionalContentNote/de> ;
    xkos:additionalContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/additionalContentNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This class includes:\n- activities of international organisations under international treaties between states, e.g.:\n • the United Nations (UN) and the specialised agencies of the United Nations system, regional bodies\n • the International Monetary Fund (IMF), the World Bank\n • the World Customs Organization (WCO), the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development (OECD)\n • the Organization of the Petroleum Exporting Countries (OPEC), the European Free Trade Association (EFTA)\n- activities of institutions and bodies of the European Union (EU)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Cette classe comprend :\n- les activités des organisations internationales dans le cadre de traités internationaux entre États, par ex. :\n • Nations unies (UN) et les agences spécialisées du système des Nations unies, les organismes régionaux\n • Fonds monétaire international (FMI), Banque mondiale\n • Organisation mondiale des douanes (OMD), Organisation de coopération et de développement économiques (OCDE)\n • Organisation des pays exportateurs de pétrole (OPEP), Association européenne de libre-échange (AELE)\n- les activités des institutions et organes de l'Union européenne (UE)"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Klasse umfasst:\n- Tätigkeiten internationaler Organisationen im Rahmen internationaler Verträge zwischen Staaten, z. B.:\n• die Vereinten Nationen (VN) und die Sonderorganisationen des Systems der Vereinten Nationen, Regionalorganisationen\n• der Internationale Währungsfonds (IWF), die Weltbank\n• die Weltzollorganisation (WZO), die Organisation für wirtschaftliche Zusammenarbeit und Entwicklung (OWZE)\n• die Organisation erdölexportierender Länder (OPEC), die Europäische Freihandelsassoziation (EFTA)\n- Tätigkeiten von Institutionen und Organen der Europäischen Union (EU)"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questa classe include:\n- attività di organizzazioni internazionali in base a trattati internazionali tra Stati, quali:\n • Nazioni Unite (ONU) e le agenzie specializzate del sistema delle Nazioni Unite, gli organismi regionali\n • Fondo Monetario Internazionale (FMI), la Banca Mondiale\n • Organizzazione Mondiale delle Dogane (OMD), Organizzazione per la Cooperazione e lo Sviluppo Economico (OCSE)\n • Organizzazione dei Paesi Esportatori di Petrolio (OPEC), Organizzazione Europea di Libero Scambio (EFTA)\n- attività di istituzioni e organismi dell'Unione Europea (UE)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/additionalContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This class also includes:\n- activities of general government agencies of other countries (e.g. embassies, consulates, military bases, scientific bases)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/additionalContentNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Cette classe comprend également :\n- les activités des administrations publiques d'autres pays (par ex. ambassades, consulats, bases militaires, bases scientifiques)"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/additionalContentNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Klasse umfasst ferner:\n- Tätigkeiten von Behörden anderer Staaten (z. B. Botschaften, Konsulate, Militärstützpunkte, wissenschaftliche Einrichtungen)"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900/note/additionalContentNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questa classe include inoltre:\n- attività di agenzie governative di altre nazioni, ad esempio ambasciate, consolati, basi militari, basi scientifiche"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990001> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "990001" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Embassies and consulates"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ambassades et consulats"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Botschaften und Konsulate"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ambasciate e consolati"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990001/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990001/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990001/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990001/note/inclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990001/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- activities of embassies, embassies’ consular sections and permanent missions throughout the country\n- activities of consulates or vice-consulates throughout the country"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990001/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les activités des ambassades, des sections consulaires des ambassades et des missions permanentes dans l'ensemble du pays\n- les activités des consulats ou vice-consulats dans l'ensemble du pays"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990001/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Tätigkeiten der Botschaften, Konsularabteilungen von Botschaften und ständigen Vertretungen im Land\n- Tätigkeiten der Konsulate oder Vizekonsulate im Land"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990001/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- attività delle ambasciate, delle sezioni consolari delle ambasciate e delle missioni permanenti presenti sul territorio nazionale\n- attività di consolati o viceconsolati sul territorio nazionale"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "990002" ;
    skos:prefLabel "International organisations"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/9900> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Organisations internationales"@fr ;
    skos:prefLabel "Internationale Organisationen"@de ;
    skos:prefLabel "Organizzazioni internazionali"@it ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/inclusionNote> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/inclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/inclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:inclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/inclusionNote/it> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/exclusionNote> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/exclusionNote/fr> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/exclusionNote/de> ;
    xkos:exclusionNote <http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/exclusionNote/it> .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/inclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type includes:\n- activities of international organisations under international treaties between states, e.g.:\n • the United Nations Organisation (UN)\n • the International Labour Organization (ILO)\n • the World Health Organisation (WHO)\n • the International Telecommunication Union (ITU)\n • the World Meteorological Organization (WMO)\n • the World Intellectual Property Organization (WIPO)\n • the International Bureau of Education (IBE)\n • the World Trade Organisation (WTO)\n • the European Organization for Nuclear Research (CERN)\n • the European Free Trade Association (EFTA)\n • the International Organisation for Migration (IOM)\n • the Inter-Parliamentary Union (IPU)\n • the International Civil Defence Organisation (OIPC)\n • the International Union for the Protection of New Varieties of Plants (UPOV)\n • the International Textiles and Clothing Bureau (ITCB)\n • the Universal Postal Union (UPU)\n • the Intergovernmental Organisation for International Carriage by Rail (OTIF)\n • the Bank for International Settlements (BIS)"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/inclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre comprend :\n- les activités des organisations internationales dans le cadre de traités internationaux entre États, par ex. :\n • Organisation des Nations unies (ONU)\n • Organisation internationale du travail (OIT)\n • Organisation mondiale de la santé (OMS)\n • Union internationale des télécommunications (UIT)\n • Organisation météorologique mondiale (OMM)\n • Organisation mondiale de la propriété intellectuelle (OMPI)\n • Bureau international d'éducation (BIE)\n • Organisation mondiale du commerce (OMC)\n • Organisation européenne pour la recherche nucléaire (CERN)\n • Association européenne de libre-échange (AELE)\n • Organisation internationale pour les migrations (OIM)\n • Union interparlementaire (UIP)\n • Organisation internationale de défense civile (OIPC)\n • Union internationale pour la protection des obtentions végétales (UPOV)\n • Bureau international des textiles et de l'habillement (BITH)\n • Union postale universelle (UPU)\n • Organisation intergouvernementale pour les transports internationaux ferroviaires (OTIF)\n • Banque des règlements internationaux (BRI)"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/inclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst:\n- Tätigkeiten von internationalen Organisationen im Rahmen von internationalen Verträgen zwischen Staaten, z. B.:\n • Organisation der Vereinten Nationen (UN)\n • Internationale Arbeitsorganisation (ILO)\n • Weltgesundheitsorganisation (WHO)\n • Internationale Fernmeldeunion (ITU)\n • Weltorganisation für Meteorologie (WMO)\n • Weltorganisation für geistiges Eigentum (WIPO)\n • Internationale Büro für Bildung (IBE)\n • Welthandelsorganisation (WTO)\n • Europäische Organisation für Kernforschung (CERN)\n • Europäische Freihandelsassoziation (EFTA)\n • Internationale Organisation für Migration (IOM)\n • Interparlamentarische Union (IPU)\n • Internationale Organisation für den Zivilschutz (OIPC)\n • Internationale Verband zum Schutz von Pflanzenzüchtungen (UPOV)\n • Internationale Büro für Textilien und Bekleidung (ITCB)\n • Weltpostverein (UPU)\n • Zwischenstaatliche Organisation für den internationalen Eisenbahnverkehr (OTIF)\n • Bank für Internationalen Zahlungsausgleich (BIZ)"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/inclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere include:\n- le attività delle organizzazioni internazionali previste dai trattati internazionali tra Stati, ad esempio:\n • Organizzazione delle Nazioni Unite (ONU)\n • Organizzazione internazionale del lavoro (OIL)\n • Organizzazione mondiale della sanità (OMS)\n • Unione Internazionale delle Telecomunicazioni (UIT)\n • Organizzazione meteorologica mondiale (OMM)\n • Organizzazione mondiale della proprietà intellettuale (OMPI)\n • Ufficio internazionale dell'educazione (IBE)\n • Organizzazione mondiale del commercio (OMC)\n • Organizzazione europea per la ricerca nucleare (CERN)\n • Associazione europea di libero scambio (AELS)\n • Organizzazione internazionale per le migrazioni (OIM)\n • Unione interparlamentare (UIP)\n • Organizzazione internazionale di difesa civile (OIPC)\n • Unione internazionale per la protezione delle nuove varietà vegetali (UIPNV)\n • Ufficio internazionale del tessile e dell'abbigliamento (UITA)\n • Unione postale universale (UPU)\n • Organizzazione intergovernativa per i trasporti internazionali per ferrovia (OTIF)\n • Banca dei regolamenti Internazionali (BRI)"@it .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/exclusionNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "This type excludes:\n\n- activities of non-governmental organisations (NGOs), see 9499, 889901"@en .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/exclusionNote/fr> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Ce genre ne comprend pas :\n\n- les activités des organisations non gouvernementales (ONG), voir 9499, 889901"@fr .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/exclusionNote/de> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Diese Art umfasst nicht:\n- Tätigkeiten von Nichtregierungsorganisationen (NGOs), siehe 9499, 889901"@de .

<http://classif-mcp.local/i14y/noga2025/990002/note/exclusionNote/it> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Questo genere non include:\n- attività di organizzazioni non governative (ONG), cfr. 9499, 889901"@it .

